<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Mwela Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">A MATEI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ngani Jammbone Malinga Pujijandikwe na a Matei</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matei</para>
  <para style="toc3">MAT</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ngani ja Mmbone Malinga Pujijandikwe na a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matei</para>
  <para style="imt">Shilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ngani ja Mmbone malinga pujijandikwe na a Matei, ni shitabhu sha munkumbi gwa itabhu nsheshe ya Malagano ga Ambi, itaya maisha ga a Yeshu Kilishitu. Yowe puishemwa “Ngani ja Mmbone” Puijandikwe na a Matei na a Maliko na a Yowana na a Luka bhakaweje a Yeshu. Bhaashomanga bhakakumumanyanga shakani pujajandikwe Ngani ja Mmbone na a Matei, ikabhe pana shaka sha makumi shita (60) AD. Nkali mmbali jibhajandishile jikanabhe manyika. Ikabheje inaganishiywa kuti kubhajandishile pana ku Yelushalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bhaajandika a Matei, liengo lyabho pulyaliji bhakamula koli bhakanabhe shemwa na a Yeshu kubha bhaajiganywa bhabho. Guna pubhashemwaga a Lawi. A Matei pubhaliji bhamo munkumbi gwa mitume likumi limo na bhabhili bhala, bhaajandishilenje bhaashomanga Bhayaudi. Tunakugamanya genega, pabha bhashinkubhujila jandika mala makumi shita, majandiko ga Malagano ga Bhukala. Shibhatumbilile kulanguya ni kuti, a Yeshu ni a Kilishitu bhaatapula bhaagwilwe na a Nnungu. A Matei bhajandishe ga Ukulungwa gwa a Nnungu. Bhayaudi pubhakulupalilenje kuti a Kilishitu shibhajiyebha a Mpalme bha Bhayaudi. A Matei bhashinkulolesheya kwa kaje yene ng'aniyoyo, gubhatalashiye ga Upalume gwa ku Nnungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pabha, shitabhu sha Ngani ja Mmbone shijandikwe na a Matei, shishikola majandiko gamagwinji ga Malagano ga Bhukala, kwa nneyo ni shammbone kubha kundandubho mwiitabhu ya Malagano ga Ambi. Pabha shinalundanya malagano gowe ganaabhili. Bhaashomanga bhashijangutilanga kuti, a Matei bhashiilinga kagula shiishite jandikwa itabhu nng'ano ya Shalia ibhajandishe a Musha. A Yeshu shibhaashite lunguya pa shitumbi pala (Matei 5-7) inalandanywa malinga mobha a Musha gubhapegwilwe Shalia na a Nnungu pa shitumbi pala (Ngumbui 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Ipali Mwenemo</para>
  <para style="io">1. A Matei bhanatandubha Ngani ja Mmbone kwa languya kubhelekwa kwa a Yeshu Kilishitu na tandubha kwa liengo lyabho (1-4).</para>
  <para style="io">2. A Matei bhanabheleketela ga liengo lya a Yeshu na majiganyo gabho (5-25).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kumpelo a Matei bhanakungulushila ga mpelo gwa liengo lya a Yeshu na shiwo na yuka kwabho (26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Ulongo gwa a Yeshu Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Sheshino ni shitabhu sha nndondonga gwa mena gwa lubheleko lwa a Yeshu Kilishitu bha ulongo gwa a Daudi, bha ulongo gwa a Bhulaimu, puyaaliji nnei.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>A Bhulaimu gubhankwete Ishaka, a Ishaka gubhankwete Yakobho, a Yakobho gubhankwete Yuda na ashaakulugwe na ashaapwakwe, <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>a Yuda gubhankwete Peleshi naka Shela anyinabhabhonji pubhashemwaga a Tamali, a Peleshi gubhankwete Eshiloni, a Eshiloni gubhankwete Lami. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>A Lami gubhankwete Aminadabhu. A Aminadabhu gubhankwete Nashoni, a Nashoni gubhankwete Shalomoni. <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>A Shalomoni gubhankwete Bhoashi, akwabhe Bhoashi pubhashemwaga a Laabhu, a Bhoashi gubhankwete Obhedi kwa akongobhabho a Luti, a Obhedi gubhankwete Yeshe, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Nabhalabho a Yeshe gubhankwete Mpalume Daudi. A Daudi gubhankwete Shelemani ku bhakongwe bhaliji akongobhabho a Ulia bhukala.<verse eid="MAT 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>A Shelemani gubhankwete Leobhoamu, a Leobhoamu gubhankwete Abhiya, a Abhiya gubhankwete Ashapu, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>A Ashapu gubhankwete Yoshepati, a Yoshepati gubhankwete Yolamu, a Yolamu gubhankwete Ushiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>a Ushiya gubhankwete Yoshamu, a Yoshamu gubhankwete Ashi, a Ashi gubhankwete Eshekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>a Eshekia gubhankwete Manashe, a Manashe gubhankwete Amoni, a Amoni gubhankwete Yoshiya, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>a Yoshiya gubhankwete Yekoniya na ashaapwakwe, mobha Bhayaudi gubhapelekwenje ku Bhabhuloni.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Bhayaudi bhakapelekwanjeje ku Bhabhuloni, a Yekoniya gubhankwete Sheatieli, a Sheatieli gubhankwete Shelubhabheli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>a Shelubhabheli gubhankwete Abhiudi, a Abhiudi gubhankwete Eliakimu, a Eliakimu gubhankwete Asholi, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>A Asholi gubhankwete Shadoki, a Shadoki gubhankwete Akimu, a Akimu gubhankwete Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>a Eliudi gubhankwete Eliashali, a Eliashali gubhankwete Matani, a Matani gubhankwete Yakobho, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>a Yakobho gubhaakwete a Yoshepu bhaaliji ambujebhabho a Malia, anyinabhabho a Yeshu bhaashemwa a Kilishitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Bhai puyaliji ibheleko likumi limo na nsheshe kutandubhila a Bhulaimu mpaka a Daudi na ibheleko likumi limo na nsheshe kutandubhila a Daudi mpaka pubhapelekwenje ku utumwa ku Bhabhuloni, na ibheleko likumi limo na nsheshe kutandubhila pubhapelekwenje ku utumwa ku Bhabhuloni mpaka pubhabhelekwe a Kilishitu.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhelekwa kwa a Yeshu Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Kubhelekwa kwa a Yeshu Kilishitu pukwaliji nnei, a Malia anyinabhabho a Yeshu, bhali muntemela na a Yoshepu, bhakanabhe gwabhala gubhaabhweni a Malia bhali na shitumbo kwa komboywa naka Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Pabha a Yoshepu bhashinkubha bhanguja bhakapinjileje kutokomaya ntemela gwabho, kwa nneyo gubhapinjile kwaaleka kwa nng'iyo. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Bhali nkuganishiya genego, nnugono malaika jwa Bhakulungwa gwabhakoposhele nng'agamii alinkuti, “A Yoshepu bha ulongo gwa a Daudi, nnajogope kwaatola a Malia bhabhe akongobhenu, pabha Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo ni abhatendile bhabhe na shitumbo. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Shibhakole mwana jwannume, shimunsheme lina lyakwe Yeshu, pabha jwenejo apinga tapula bhandu bhakwe na yambi yabhonji.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Genego gashinkukoposhela nkupinga limalile lilobhe libhalugwile Bhakulungwa kuka nkulondola jwabho, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Nng'ishana shakole shitumbo, shankole mwana jwannume, shibhanshemanje lina lyakwe Manueli,” malombolelo gakwe, “A Nnungu pamo na uwe”.<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Kwa nneyo, a Yoshepu bhakajumusheje gubhatendile malinga shibhalugulilwe naka malaika jula, gubhaatolile a Malia kubha akongobhabho. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Bhakaamanyiji akongobhabho a Malia mpaka bhakankoleje mwana jwannume. Na a Yoshepu gubhanshemile lina lyakwe, Yeshu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Bhajeninji Kopoka Kulikoposhela Lyubha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>A Yeshu kubhabhelekwele ku Bheteleemu, nkowa gwa ku Yudea, mobha ga a Elode pubhaliji a mpalume, a Yeshu bhakabhelekweje, bhakwiimanyanga ndondwa gubhaikengenenje ku Yelushalemu kopoka kulikoposhela lyubha, <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>gubhabhushiyenje, “Kwali kwei mwana abhelekwe, mpalume jwa Bhayaudi? Twashinkulubhona lutondwa lwakwe lulikoposhela, putwaliji kulikoposhela lyubha na uwe tushikwiya kuntindibhalila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>A Mpalume Elode bhakapilikaneje genego, gubhatengwishe na bhandu bhowe bha ku Yelushalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Bhai, gubhaashemilenje bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila bhowe na bhaajiganya bha Shalia, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Kilishitu shabhelekwe kwei?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Gubhaajangwilenje, “Ku Bheteleemu nkowa gwa ku Yudea malinga shiishite jandikwa naka nkulondola jwa a Nnungu kuti,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘Ugwe Bheteleemu uli munkowa gwa ku Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Ugwe nngabha jwanshoko muilambo imanyika ya ku Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">Pabha kunngwako apinga koposhela kalongolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">shaabhalongolelanje bhandu bhangu Ishilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Penepo, a Elode gubhaashemilenje kuntemela bhakwimanyanga ndondwa bhala, gubhaabhushiyenje shakani pulwankoposhelenje lutondwa. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Kungai gubhaatumilenje ku Bheteleemu bhalinkuti, “Nnjendangane nkabhushishiyanje ukoto ngani jika jwene mwanajo. Mummonangaga kunnugulilanje nkupinga na nne nyende ngantindibhalile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Bhakapilikananjeje malobhe ga a mpalume bhakwimanyanga ndondwa bhala gubhajabhwilenje, bhai lutondwa lubhalubhweninji bhalinginji kulikoposhela lyubha lula gulwaalongolelenje, gulupite jima panani paaliji mwana pala. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Bhakalubhonanjeje lutondwa gubhainonyelenje kaje. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Bhai, gubhajinjilenje nnyumba, gubhammweninji mwana jula na akwabhe a Malia, gubhatemingene ulungolungo kuntindibhalila. Kungai gubhagopwelenje ibhajigelenje, gubhampelenje upo, shaabhu na lubhani na manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>A Nnungu bhakwaaleyangaga nng'agamii, bhanaabhujilanje kabhili a Elode, gubhapitilenje mpanda guna kubhuja kunngwabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhutushila ku Mishili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Bhajeninji bhala bhakajabhulanjeje, malaika jwa Bhakulungwa gwabhakoposhele a Yoshepu nng'agamii, gwabhalugulile, “A Elode bhapinga kunnoleya mwanajo bhammulaje, bhai nnjumushe! Muntole mwanajo na akwabhe mmutushilanje ku Mishili, nkatamangane mpaka pushininnugulilanje kabhili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>A Yoshepu bhakajumusheje gubhantolile mwana jula na akwabhe, gubhajabhwilenje nashilo nashilo kubhutushila ku Mishili. <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>Gubhatemi kweneko mpaka pubhaawile a Elode. Genega gashinkukoposhela nkupinga gamalile galugwilwe na Bhakulungwa kwa ntenga guka nkulondola jwabho, “Nashinkunshema mwanangu kopoka ku Mishili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhana Bhashoko Bhanabhulagwanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>A Elode bhakamumanyeje kuti bhashitembwa na bhakwimanyanga ndondwa bhala, guyaashimile kaje. Gubhaamulishe bhabhulagwanje bhana bha shileu bhowe pa shilambo sha Bheteleemu na ilambo ya nnyenje jakwe bha yaka ibhili na pai jakwe. Bhashinkutenda nneyo kwa tolelela pubhalugulilwe na bhaashomanga ndondwa bhala malanga gubhalubhweninji lutondwa kulikoposhela lyubha.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Nneyo gakumalilaga malobhe galugwilwe na ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Yelemia bhalinkuti,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Lilobhe lishipilikanika ku Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">ililo na nguto yaigwinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">A Laeli bhanakwagutilanga ashibhana bhabho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">numbe bhangapinga tagwa ntima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">pabha bhana bhowe bhawilenje.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja Kopoka ku Mishili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Bhakaweje a Elode, malaika jwa Bhakulungwa gwabhakoposhele a Yoshepu nng'agamii ku Mishili kula, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>gwabhalugulile, “Nnjumushe! Muntole mwana na akwabhe, mmujangane ku shilambo sha Ishilaeli, pabha bhapingangaga kummulaga mwanajo bhala, bhawilenje.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Bhai, a Yoshepu bhakajumusheje, gubhantolile mwana jula na akwabhe, gubhabhujengene ku shilambo sha Ishilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Ikabheje a Yoshepu bhakapilikaneje kuti a Lekelao, bhana bhabho a Elode, bhashibha a mpalume bha ku Yudea gubhajogwepe kubhuja. Bhalabho bhakalugulilweje nng'agamii, gubhapite nkowa gwa ku Galilaya, <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>nikwenda tama ku shijiji sha ku Nashaleti. Nkupinga gamalile malobhe galugwilwe na ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu, “Shibhashemwe Bhanashaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Miungu ja a Yowana Bhabhatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maliko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yowana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Gene mobhago gubhakoposhele a Yowana bhaabhatisha, bhalilunguya kuanga ja ku Yudea, <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>bhalinkuti, “Mwiipetanje, pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu ubhandishile.” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Bhenebha a Yowana bhalugwilwe na ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Ishaya bhalinkuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Lilobhe lika mundu linapilikanika kuanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Mwaalashiyanje Bhakulungwa mpanda gwabho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">Nngoloyanje mushibhapite.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>A Yowana shibhawalaga shiwalo sha mabhetya ga ngamia, na nshipi gwa lipende nshigunu. Shalya shabho pushaaliji maije na bhushi gwa mukonde. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Bhai, bhandunji kukoposhela ku Yelushalemu na nkowa gowe gwa ku Yudea na ilambo yowe ya nnyenje lushi lwa Yolodani, gubhaajendelenje. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Bhakaipetanjeje yambi yabhonji na bhalabho gubhaabhatishenje mmashi ga lushi lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Ikabheje a Yowana bhakaabhonanjeje Mapalishayo na Mashadukayo bhabhagwinji bhalikwaajiilanga nkupinga bhabhatishwanje, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganya bhana bha lijoka! Gani ammalanjilenje nnjibhutukanje nnjimwa ja a Nnungu jikwiya? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Bhai nnanguyanje kwa itendi, kuti mwiipetilenje. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Nnaganishiyanje mmitima jenunji kuti, ‘Uwe, ulongo gwa a Bhulaimu!’ Ngunakummalanjilanga kuti, a Nnungu bhanakombola kugayuya aga magangaga gabhe bha ulongo bha a Bhulaimu. <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Na libhago libhishilwe tayali mmatepo ga mikongo, bhai kila nkongo ukaogoya iepo ya mmbone upinga shelwa nileshelwa pa moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Nne ngunakummatishanga kwa mashi kulangula kuti mwiipetilenje. Ikabheje bhene bhakwiya nnyuma jangubho bhashikola mashili kumbunda nne, numbe ngaatopela nkali jigala ilatu yabho. Bhenebho shibhammatishanje kwa Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo na moto. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/><figure style="fig" alt="Threshing" file="NT-06 Threshing.jpg" size="col" ref="3:12">Mundu Ashipeta Ngano</figure>Bhenebho bhashikamula shipeta mmakono gabho nkupinga bhapete, ngano bhabhishe munngokwe na maashe bhajoshe pa moto gwangaimika.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabhatishwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maliko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Gene mobhago a Yeshu gubhaishe ku lushi lwa Yolodani kukoposhela ku Galilaya, gubhaajendele a Yowana nkupinga bhabhatishwe. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Ikabheje a Yowana gubhalinjile kwaibhilila bhalinkuti, “Nne namwene ngunapinga bhatishwa na mmwe, pakuti nnanyiila nne?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nnaino mmwe nneshepe ibhe nneyo, pabha inapinjikwa tutende yowe ibhaapinga a Nnungu.” Bhai, a Yowana gubhakundile.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>A Yeshu bhakabhatishweje gubhakopweshe mmashi, shangupe ku nnungu kukuugukaga, gubhammweni Mbumu jwa a Nnungu alituluka mbuti nnjubha nikwaatula panani jabho. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Lilobhe gulipilikanishe koposhela kunnungu, “Jweneju mwanangu jungumpinga annonyela.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalingwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maliko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Kungai Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo gwabhalongweye a Yeshu mpaka kuanga nkupinga bhakalingwe naka Lishetani. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Gubhatabhile mobha makumi nsheshe shilo na mui, kungai gubhakwete shibhanga. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Bhai, Lishetani gwabhaishile kukwaalinga, alinkuti, “Monaga mmwe nni Mwana jwa a Nnungu, nngaamulishe magangaga gabhe mikate.” <verse eid="MAT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Ishijandikwa, ‘Mundu akaalamila nkatepe, ikabhe kwa kila lilobhe libhaabheleketa a Nnungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Lishetani gwabhalongweye kwenda ku Yelushalemu, Shilambo sha Ukonjelo, gwabhakweshiye kunani kaje liekalu, <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>gwabhalugulile, “Monaga nni Mwana jwa a Nnungu, mwileshele pai, pabha ishijandikwa. ‘A Nnungu shibhaamulishe malaika bhabho kukunjangutila, shibhannjigalanje mmakono gabhonji nkupinga nnaiulaye lukongono lwenu pa liganga.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>A Yeshu gubhannugulile, “Nneilapeila ishijandikwa, ‘Nnaalinje Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhenu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Kungai Lishetani gwabhalongweye kabhili kunani shitumbi shashileu, gwabhalangwiye upalume gwa kila shilambo pa shilambolyo na indu yakwe yowe ya konja, <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>akwaalugulilaga, “Nng'wilaga ulungolungo nindindibhalila, shinimpe indu yowei.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Penepo, a Yeshu gubhannugulile, “Shoka apano Lishetani! Ishijandikwa, ‘Mwaatindibhalile na kwaakamulila maengo Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhenu jikape.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Bhai, Lishetani gwabhaleshile a Yeshu na ashimalaika gubhaikengene kukwaatumishila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaatandubha Liengo ku Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maliko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Bhai a Yeshu bhakapilikaneje kuti a Yowana bhashitabhwa nnigelesha, gubhapite ku Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Gubhajabhwile ku Nashaleti shijiji shaaliji ku Galilaya, gubhapite tama ku Kapalanaumu, shilambo shaaliji nnyenje litanda lya Galilaya, mumpika gwa ilambo ya makabhila ga Shabhuloni na Naputali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Bhai gulimalile lilobhe lyalugwilwe na a Ishaya ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhalinkuti, <verse eid="MAT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Ilambo ya makabhila ga Shabhuloni na Naputali, kuloya kubhaali kung'ambu lushi lwa Yolodani, ku Galilaya ilambo ya bhandu bhangabha Bhayaudi, <verse eid="MAT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>bhandu bhatemingene nnubhindu bhashikushibhonanga shilangaya shikulungwa, bhatemingene nnubhindu na shiwili sha shiwo, shilangaya shishikwaalangashiyanga!”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Kuumila penepo a Yeshu gubhatandwibhe kulunguya bhalinkuti, “Mwiipetanje yambi yenunji, pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu ubhandishile!”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaashemanga Bhatanda Yamaki Nsheshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maliko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>A Yeshu bhalipita nnyenje litanda lya Galilaya, gubhaabhweninji bhandu bhabhili, a Shimoni guna bhashemwaga a Petili na apwabho a Ndeleya, bhalitejelanga lyau nkutanda yamaki. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Bhai, gubhaalugulinje, “Nngagulanje, shininnjiganyanje kwaajiyanabhonji bhandunji kwangu nne, malinga shinkutandanga yamaki.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Shangupe gubhaleshilenje mau gabhonji, gubhaakagwilenje.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Bhakajendeje mmujo kashoko, gubhaabhweninji bhananji bhabhili a Yakobho na apwabho a Yowana, bhana bha a Shebhedayo. Pubhalinginji muntumbwi na ainabhabhonji a Shebhedayo, bhalialayanga mau gabhonji. Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaashemilenje, <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>shangupe gubhaguleshilenje ntumbwi gula na ainabhabhonji, nigubhaakagwilenje.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaajiganya Bhandu na Lamya Bhalwelenji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>A Yeshu bhatendaga owela mmbali yowe ya ku Galilaya na jiganya mmashinagogi na kwaalugushiyanga Ngani ja Mmbone ja Upalume gwa a Nnungu. Na lamya kila ilwele ibhakwetenje bhandu. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Yowe ibhatendile ila guishumile nkowa gowe gwa ku Shilia. Bhalwelenji bha kila namuna na bhakwetenje maoka na bhalwelenji shialala na bhandunji bhapolokanga, gubhaapeleshelenje nabhalabho gubhaalamiyenje bhowe. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Bhandunji bhabhagwinji gubhaakagwilenje koposhela mmbali ja ku Galilaya na ku Dekapoli na ku Yelushalemu na ku Yudea na ku ng'ambu lushi lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo ga pa Shitumbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>A Yeshu bhakaabhonanjeje bhandunji bhabhagwinji, gubhakwelile pa shitumbi gubhatemi. Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>nabhalabho gubhatandwibhe kwaajiganyanga bhalinkuti.<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuangalala kwa Kweli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>Mbaya bhaalaganga mmitima jabhonji, pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu gwabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Mbaya bhainjikenje, pabha shibhaangalaywanje. <verse eid="MAT 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Mbaya bhaitimalikenje, pabha shibhapegwanje shilambo. <verse eid="MAT 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Mbaya bhakwetenje lilaka na lokolila tenda ibhapinga a Nnungu, pabha shibhatendanje. <verse eid="MAT 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Mbaya bhakwetenje shiya, pabha a Nnungu shibhaabhonelanje shiya. <verse eid="MAT 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Mbaya bhakwetenje ng'aniyo ya mmbone mmitima jabhonji, pabha shibhaabhonanje a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Mbaya bhaaloleyanga ulele, pabha shibhashemwanje bhana bha a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Mbaya bhaapotekwanga kwa ligongo lya tenda ibhapinga a Nnungu, pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu gwabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Mbaya mmanganyanji bhandunji bhantukanangaga na kumpotekanga na kunnambililanga kila indu yangali ya mmbone kwa ligongo lyangu nne. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Mwiinonyelanje na angalila pabha upo yenunji yaigwinji kunnungu. Ni nnepeyo shibhaapotekenje ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhukala, nkanabhe bhelekwanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnjete na Shilangaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maliko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Mmanganyanji mbuti nnjete ja shilambolyo! Nnjete jikanonye jitagwe nndi jinonye kabhili? Jikapwaa kabhili, ikabhe kujawa palanga jilibhatwe na bhandunji.<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Mmanganyanji mbuti shilangaya sha shilambolyo! Mbuti shilangaya sha shilambo shili pa shitumbi shikaishika. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Wala bhandu bhakakoleyanga kandili niunishila lidebhe, ikabheje pabhika panani mesha jaamulishilanje bhowe bhalinginji nnyumba. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Nneyo peyo shilangaya shenunji shilangaye pa bhandunji, nkupinga bhaibhonanje itendi yenunji ya mmbone, bhaakuyanje Ainabhenunji bhali kunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Shalia ja a Musha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Nnaganishiyanje kuti njikwiya angabhanya Shalia ya a Musha na majiganyo ga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu. Nangaika kuangabhanya, ikabhe kuumalishiya. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Kweli ngunakummanjilanga, mpaka kunnungu na shilambolyo pushiipitepo, shakwa nkali shishoko sha shalia shipinga shoywa mpaka gowe pushigamalile. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Bhai, jojowe akaakunda nkali amuli jimo jili jajishoko punda yowe, nikwaajiganyanga bhananji bhanakundanje, jwenejo shaabhe jwanshoko Muupalume gwa Kunnungu. Ikabheje jwene shaakunde shalia nikwaajiganyanga bhananji kukunda shalia, jwenejo shaabhe jwankulungwa Muupalume gwa Kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Kwa nneyo ngunakummalanjilanga, aki jenunji ibhaga jikapunde ja Ashimapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha Shalia, ngu, nkajinjilanga Muupalume gwa Kunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Nnjimwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Mpilikenenje bhanyikala bhashinkulugulilwanga, ‘Nnabhulaje! Shabhulajejo shapate ukumu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Ikabheje nne ngunakummalanjilanga, jojowe akuntumbalila mpwakwe shaukumulwe, akunnyegaya mpwakwe shapelekwe ku lukumbi kuukumulwa. Na akunshema mpwakwe nngumba anapinjikwa kuleshelwa pa moto gwa ku Jeanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>“Bhai, monaga nnipinga shoya mbepei yenu pa shitala, nikumbushila kuti mpwenu ashikola mpwai na mmwe, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>nneshe mbepei yenu pa shitala, nkatandubhe kulundana naka mpwenu, kungai mmuje nshoye mbepei yenu.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Shangupe mpatane naka mmagongo nnjenu nninginji mumpanda nkanabhe ika ku bhaukumula. Nkupinga mmagongo nnjenujo anampeleshe kubhaukumula, na bhaukumula nikunkamuya ku bhalinda bhantabhanje. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjila, nkakopoka mwenemo mpaka pushinnipe mmbiya yowe.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Labhalabha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Mpilikenenje kuti bhandunji bhashinkulugulilwanga, ‘Nnalabhelabhe!’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Ikabheje nne ngunakummalanjilanga, jojowe akunnola jwankongwe kwa kunnokolila, muntima gwakwe alebhelebhe najo. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Bhai, monaga liyo lyenu lya kunnilo linnebhiyaga, nnikolotole nkajae kwaatalika. Mbaya shiobhe shibhalo shimo pa shiilu shenu, nngalingana shiilu shenu showe kujawa pa moto gwa ku Jeanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Monaga nkono nnilo gwenu unnebhiyaga, nngukate nkaujae kwaatalika. Mbaya shiobhe shibhalo shimo pa shiilu shenu, nngalingana shiilu showe kuleshelwa pa moto gwa ku Jeanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Lekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matei 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maliko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Numbe yalugwilwe, ‘Mundu akunneka nkagwe, annjandishile talaka.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Ikabheje nne ngunakummalanjilanga, akumpa nkagwe talaka ikabhe kwa ligongo lya labhalabha, anakuntenda alabhelabhe, naka jwannume annombaga jwankongwe aleshilwe na ambujegwe, analabhalabha.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Lumbila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Kabhili mpilikenenje kuti bhanyikala bhashinkubhalanjilwanga, ‘Nnalumbile kwa unami, ikabhe nnaapinjikwa ntende imwaalumbile Bhakulungwa,’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Ikabheje nne ngunakummalanjilanga, nnalumbilanje wala kunnungu, pabha shitengu sha Upalume gwa a Nnungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>wala shilambolyo, pabha palibhatila makongono gabho, wala ku Yelushalemu, pabha shilambo sha a Mpalume bhakulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Wala nnalumbile kwa ntwe gwenu, pabha nkaakombola kulutenda luumbo lwenu lumo lubhe lwanawe eu lwanapi, <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Mmeleketaga, ‘Elo,’ bhai ibhe ‘Elo,’ mmeleketaga, ‘Nngabha,’ bhai ibhe ‘Nngabha.’ Pabha shoshowe shiipunda penepo kushikoposhela kuka Lishetani.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Pindikulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Mpilikenenje kuti yabheleketwe, ‘Liyo kwa liyo, lino kwa lino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Ikabheje nne ngunakummalanjilanga, nnampindikulile mundu akunshima. Mundu ankomaga lipapa litukwa lya kunnilo, muntendebhushiye na lya kunshinda. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Mundu anng'ukumulaga nkupinga atole lishati lyenu, munneshele atole na likoti lyenu, <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Mundu anshishilishiaga munjigalile nshigo gwakwe maili jimo, munjigalile maili gabhili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Akunnjuga shindu mumpe, na jwalakwe apinga kumpoleka nnantundumalile.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaapinganje Ashaamagongo Ajenunji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Mpilikenenje yabheleketwe kuti, ‘Mwaapinje atami ajenu, na kwaashima amagongo ajenu.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Ikabheje nne ngunakummalanjilanga, mwaapinje amagongo ajenu na mwaajujile kwa a Nnungu bhakumpoteka, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>nkupinga mmanganje bhana bha Ainabhenunji bha kunnungu. Pabha bhenebho bhanakwaalangashiyanga lyubha bhandu bhowe bha mmbone na bhangalinginji bha mmbone na bhananyeya ula ku bhakwetenje aki na bhangakolanga aki. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Kwa nndi a Nnungu bhampanganje upo mwaapingangaga bhandu bhakumpinganga? Pabha, nkali bhakamula koli pubhatendanga nneyo peyo! <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Monaga mwaabhuyangaga abhali ashaalongo ajenunjipe, bhuli nkutendanga shindu shashi sha punda? Pabha nkali bhandu bhangabha Bhayaudi pubhatendanga nneyo peyo? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Bhai, nkamilikanje malinga shibhakamilishe Ainabhenunji bha kunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Ga Kwaajangutilanga Bhangalinji na Indu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Mwiteiganje nnatendanje indu ya mmbone pa bhandu nkupinga bhammonanje. Nngabha nneyo, Ainabhenunji bha kunnungu bhakampanganga upo.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Bhai, punkunnjangutila jwangali shindu, nnagombe mmbila. Nnatende malinga shibhaatendanga bhagulumba mmashinagogi na mmipanda, nkupinga bhalumbililwanje na bhandunji. Kweli ngunakunnugulilanga, bhene bhanganyabho bhapatilenje upo yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Ikabheje punkunnjangutila mundu jwangali shindu, nkali mundu jwa tome na mmwe, anamumanye inkutenda. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Nshoye mbepei yenu kwa nng'iyo, na Ainabhenu bhakwiibhona indu ya nng'iyo, shibhanng'upe.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Kwaajuga a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Punkwaajuganga a Nnungu, nnatendanje malinga bhagulumba. Pabha bhanganyabho, pubhajuganga bhanaapinganga kujima mmashinagogi na nnyenje mipanda nkupinga bhalolwanje na bhandunji. Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, bhalabhonji bhapatilenje upo yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Ikabheje mmwe punkwaajuga a Nnungu, nnjinjile kukati jenu, nng'ugale nnango, mwaajuje Ainabhenu bhakabhonekana. Na bhalabho Ainabhenu bhakwibhona indu ya nng'iyo, shibhanng'upe.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Punkwaajuganga a Nnungu, nnajobhelanje malinga bhandunji bhangabha Bhayaudi. Pabha pubhaaganishiyanga kuti a Nnungu shibhaapilikanilanje kwa ligongo lya gwinji gwa malobhe gabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Nnabhanganje malinga bhanganyabho. Pabha Ainabhenunji bhaimanyi inkupinganga, nkali nkanabhe kwaajuganga. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Bhai, nnjuganje nnei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Atati nni kunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">Lina lyenu likuywe.<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>Upalume gwenu guishe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">Linkupinga mmwe litendeshe pa shilambolyo malinga shiikutendeka kunnunguko.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Ntupe lelo shalya sha togolela lelo.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Ntuleshelele itulebhile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">malinga na uwe shitukwaaleshelelanga bhatulebhilenje.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Nnatubhishe mmalinjilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">ikabheje ntuembuye naka Lishetani jula. Pabha upalume ni gwenu na mashili na ukonjelo pitipiti. Amina.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana ga bhukala gangali gene malobhego, “Pabha upalume ni gwenu na mashili na ukonjelo pitipiti. Amina.”</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Pabha Mwaaleshelelangaga bhandu ibhannebhilenje, nneyo peyo Ainabhenunji bha kunnungu shibhanneshelelanje innebhilenje. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Ikabheje nkaaleshelelanje bhandunji yambi yabhonji, na bhalabho Ainabhenunji bhakanneshelelanga innebhilenje.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani ja Tabha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Punkutabhanga, nnaumalanje kumeyo malinga bhagulumba. Bhanaumalanga kumeyo nkupinga bhabhonekanje na bhandu kuti bhashitabhanga. Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga bhanganyabho, bhapatilenje upo yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Ikabheje mmwe punkutabha, nnabhe kumeyo na mpakale mauta muntwe. <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>Nkupinga bhandunji bhanamumanyanje kuti nnatabha, ikabheje mmanyishepe na Ainabhenu bhakaabhoneka, nabhalabho Ainabhenu bhakwiibhona ya nng'iyo shibhanng'upe.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Shibhiko Kunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Nnaibhishilanje shibhiko pa shilambolyo pano, ipukuu na nkubha inaangabhanya na bhagwii bhanakaaanga nijibha. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Ikabhe mwibhishilanje indu yenunji kunnungu kwikaangabhanika na ipukuu na nkubha, nkali bhagwii bhakakaanga nijibha. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Pabha pushili shibhiko shenu, na ntima gwenu shugubhe popo.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilangaya sha Shiilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Liyo mbuti kandili ja shiilu, bhai liyo libhaga lyalikoto, shililangaye shiilu shenu showe. <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>Ikabheje liyo libhaga lilwele shiilu shenu showe shishibhe nnubhindu. Bhai, ibhaga shilangaya shili nkati jenu shilepelaga kulangaya, shilubhe lubhindu lwa punda!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Nnungu na Mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Jwakwa ntumwa akombola kwaatumishilanga bhakulungwanji bhabhili, pabha shanshime jumo nikumpinga junajo, eu shalongane naka jumo nikumpetekuya junajo. Nkakombola kwaatumishila a Nnungu na tumishila mali.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnakolanje Lipamba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">Luka 12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Kwa nneyo ngunakummalanjilanga, nnakolanje lipamba ga gumi gwenunji, kuti nniyanganje nndi eu mpapilanje nndi, wala ga iilu yenunji kuti nng'walanje nndi. Bhuli, gumi ukapunda shalya? Bhuli, shiilu shikapunda iwalo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Mwilolanje ijuni ya mukonde, ikapanda, wala ikauna na wala yangali nngokwe jojowe. Nkali nneyo Ainabhenunji bha kunnungu bhanakwiiliya. Bhuli, mmanganyanji nngabha mmammbonenji kupunda ijuniyo? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Gani munkumbi gwenunji kwa kola lipamba kwakwe anakombola kwijenjesheya kapela lyubha limo lya mobha gakwe galama?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Kwa nndi kola lipamba ga iwalo? Nnolanje malubha ga mukonde shigakutikonja? Gakakamula liengo wala gakapota. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Ikabheje ngunakummalanjilanga, nkali a Mpalume a Shelemani bhayene na yowe ibhaakwete bhangawashwa kwa konja malinga lilubha limo. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Bhai ibhaga a Nnungu bhanakuliwasha liamba lya mmigunda, lelo lipali na malabhi lilileshelwa pa lituto lya moto, bhuli bhakapunda kunng'washanga mmanganyanji? Mmanganya nkwetenje ngulupai jishoko.<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Bhai, nnakolanje lipamba, ‘Shitulye indi eu shitupapile indi eu shituwale indi!’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Pabha bhandu bhakakwaamanyanga a Nnungu bhanaabhushilanga yene yoweyo. Ainabhenunji bhali kunnungu bhamumanyi kuti nnakwiipinganga indu yoweyo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Ikabhe, nnoleyanje oti Upalume gwa a Nnungu na aki jabho na gene gowego, a Nnungu shibhannjenjesheyanje. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Bhai, nnaabhushilanje ya malabhi, pabha malabhi shigaiabhushile gayene. Shilaje sha lyubha limo shinatogolela kwa lyubha lyolyo.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Ga Ukumula Bhananji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Nnaukumulanje bhananji, a Nnungu bhanakwiya kunng'ukumulanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Pabha shinkwaukumulanga bhananji, nneyo peyo na mmanganyanji pushinng'ukumulwanje, shipimilo shinkwapimilanga bhananji na a Nnungu shibhampimilanje shosho. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Bhai, pakuti nnakushibhona shipande shili nniyo lika mpwenu, na lipoto lili nniyo lyenu nnalibhone? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Nkukombola bhuli kunnugulila mpwenu, ‘Leka nikushoye shipande nniyo lyako,’ akuno nninkwete lipande nniyo lyenu? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Mmwe mmagulumba! Nshoyeti lipande litemi nniyo lyenu, penepo shinnole ukoto nikombola shoya shipande shili nniyo lika mpwenu.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Nnaapanganje ashimbwa indu ya ukonjelo, bhanatendebhukanga nikunnumanga, wala nnaaleshelelanje lulu yenunji ashingulubhe, bhanalibhatanga.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Juga na Loleya na Olishiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Nnjuganje na mmanganyanji shimpegwanje, nnoleyanje na mmanganyanji shimpatanje, nng'olishiyanje na mmanganyanji shing'ugulilwanje. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Pabha, jojowe ajuga anaposhela, aloleya anapata, na aolishiya anaugulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Bhuli, apali jojowe munkumbi gwenunji atenda mwanagwe annjugaga nkate shampe liganga? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Eu annjugaga shamaki, shampe lijoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Bhai, monaga mmanganyanji, nkali nninginji mwangali bha mmbonenji, nnamanyanga kwaapanganga ashibhana bhenu indu ya mmbone, bhuli! Ainabhenunji bhali kunnungu bhakapunda kwapanganga ya mmbone bhakwaajugangabho?<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Bhai yowe inkupinganga bhandu bhantendelanje na mmanganyanji mwaatendelanje nneyo peyo. Pabha genega ni malombolelo ga Shalia ja a Musha na majiganyo ga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnango Gwanshoko na Gwankulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Nnjinjilangane pitila nnango gwa nyilila, pabha mpanda guloya kuobha ushipanuka na nnango gwa jinjilila kweneko gushipanuka na bhabhagwinji bhaapitanga gwene mpandago. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Ikabheje nnango gwanshoko na mpanda gukwenda kugumi gushibhana na bhakuubhonanga gwene mpandago, bhashokope.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo na Iepo Yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Mwiteiganje na ashinkulondola bha unami, bhakunnjiilanga bhalibhonekanga mbuti ngondolo, ikabheje kwa nkati maogo ga jogoya. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Bhai, shimwaamanyanje kwa itendi yabhonji. Bhuli, bhandu bhalikabhanga shabhibhu mmaukutu ga mibha, eu tini mmbigili? Ng'oo! <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Bhai, nkongo gwa mmbone gunaogoya iepo ya mmbone, nkongo gwangali gwa mmbone gunaogoya iepo yangali ya mmbone. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Nkongo gwa mmbone gukaogoya iepo yangali ya mmbone, na wala nkongo gwangali gwa mmbone gukaogoya iepo ya mmbone. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Nkongo gogowe gukaogoya iepo ya mmbone gupinga shelwa na leshelwa pa moto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Kwa nneyo, shimwaamanyanje ashinkulondola bha unami kwa itendi yabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaajiganywa bha Kweli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Nngabha kila mundu anjema, ‘Mmakulungwa, Mmakulungwa,’ shajinjile Muupalume gwa Kunnungu, ikabhe jwene shatende ibhapinga Atati bhali Kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Lyubha lya ukumu bhabhagwinji shibhamalanjilanje, ‘Mmakulungwa, Mmakulungwa! Kwa lina lyenu twatendaga londola na kwa lina lyenu twatendaga shoya maoka, na tenda ilapo yaigwinji.’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Penepo shinaabhalanjilanje, ‘Ngu, nangammanyanga mmanganyanji, nnjokanganile apano mmanganya nkutendanga yambi.’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaashenga Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Kwa nneyo, mundu jojowe apilikana malobhe gangu nitenda, shalandane naka mundu akwete lunda, ashenjile nyumba pa ndandali niolela iishi yakwe ukoto na nyumba nikamilika mbuti jishenjilwe pa liganga likulu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Ula gujinyele, nushi gwigumbele mashi, mbungo jikulungwa jikupugaga nikoma nyumbajo, ikabheje jangagwa pabha jashinkuolelwa ukoto nikamilika mbuti jishenjilwe pa liganga likulu.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Ikabheje jojowe apilikana malobhe gangu ninngatenda, shalandane naka mundu nngumba ashenjile nyumba jakwe pa lianji. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Ula gujinyele, na nushi guigumbele mashi, na mbungo gujipujile nikoma nyumba jila, gujigwile, numbe kwa ng'indo gwa nkulungwa.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mashili ga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje kubheleketa gene malobhego, bhandu bhashinkukanganigwanga na majiganyo gabho. <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>Pabha bhatendaga jiganya malinga mundu akwete ukulungwa, nngabha malinga bhaajiganya bha Shalia bhananji.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunamya Mundu jwa Mangundula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maliko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>A Yeshu bhakaeleleje kopoka kushitumbi, bhandunji bhabhagwinji gubhaakagulenje. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Bhai, gwaishe mundu jumo akwete mangundula nitindibhala alinkuti, “Mmakulungwa, mpingaga nnakombola kunamiya!” <verse eid="MAT 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>A Yeshu gubhagolweye nkono, gubhankwashiye bhalinkuti, “Ngunapinga! Ulame.” Shangupe gwalamile mangundula gakwe. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhannugulile, “Upilikane, unannugulile mundu jojowe, ikabhe ujende ukailanguye ku bhaabhishila, ukapeleshe mbepei malinga shiyalugwilwe na a Musha kwaakong'ondelanga kuti nnamile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunamya Ntumishi jwa Bhakulungwa bha Manjola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>A Yeshu bhalijinjila ku Kapalanaumu, nkulungwa jwa manjola jumo gwabhajendele, gwabhashondelesheye <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>alinkuti, “Mmakulungwa, ntumishi jwangu kumui, ashigona nnwele kaje.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Shinyie ninnamiye.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Bhakulungwa bha manjola bhala gubhaajangwile bhalinkuti, “Mmakulungwa, nne nngabha najwa mmbone kwa jinjila mmwe nnyumba jangu, ikabheje mmelekete lilobhepe naka ntumishi jwangu shalame. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Pabha nkali nne nili pai ja ukulungwa uka mundu juna, njikola ashimanjola bhalinginji pai jangu. Ninnugulilaga jumo, ‘Jabhula!’ Anajabhula, naka juna, ‘Jia!’ Alikwiiya, naka ntumwa jwangu, ‘Tenda ashi!’ Anaatenda.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje genego, gubhakanganigwe, gubhaalugulilenje bhaakulupalilangaga bhala, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nganabhe kummona mundu pa shilambo sha Ishilaeli akwete ngulupai jikulungwa malinga jeneji. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Bhai, ngunakummalanjilanga kuti bhandu bhabhagwinji bhapinga kwiyangana kopoka kulikoposhela lyubha na kulititimila, nabhalabhonji bhapinga tamangana pa kalamu na a Bhulaimu na a Ishaka na a Yakobho Muupalume gwa Kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Ikabheje bhapinjikwangaga kubha Muupalume shibhabhinjilwanje ku lubhindu lwa palanga, kushibhagutanje na tauna meno.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaalugulile bhakulungwa bha manjola bhala, “Mmuje kumui, ibhe malinga shinshite kulupalila.” Naka ntumishi jwabho gwalamile malanga gala.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaalamya Bhandu Bhabhagwinji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maliko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>A Yeshu gubhaishe kungwabho a Petili, gubhaaimene akwebhabho a Petili anyinabhabho akongobhabho bhali bhagonile pashinanda, bhalwele. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaakwashiye nkono gwabho bhalwele bhala na shilwele shila shikwaalekaga, gubhajinwishe nikwatumishilanga.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Likaishileje ligulo gubhaapeleshelenje bhandunji bhabhagwinji bhakwetenje maoka, gubhaabhinjilenje ashimaoka kwa bheleketape. Na kwaalamyanga bhalwelenji bhowe. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Bhashinkutenda nneyo nkupinga limalile lilobhe lyalugwilwe na ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Ishaya kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">“Bhashitola ugwangali mashili gwetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 8:17">Bhashijigala ilwele yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bhaapinjikwanga Kubha Bhaakagula</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>A Yeshu bhakalubhoneje lugwinjili lwa bhandu lwaatimbilile, gubhaamulishenje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhajombokanje litanda. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>A Mwalimu bha Shalia bhamo gubhaajendele, gubhaalugulile, “Mmaajiganya, nne mbinga kunkagula kokowe kushinnjende.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nansheto akwete lishembo, na ijuni ishikola maui, ikabhe Mwana juka Mundu jwangali pa pumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Kungai mundu jwa munkumbi gwa bhaajiganywa bhabho gwabhalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, nnesheoti nyende ngaashishe Atati.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhannugulile, “Ngagula! Bhandunji bhakakwaapinganga a Nnungu nimalinga bhawilenje, bhalekanje bhawilenje bhashikane ashaayenenji.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaamulisha Mabhimbili Gatondobhe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maliko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>A Yeshu gubhakwelile muntumbwi, pamo na bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhapitengenenje. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Kashokope, mbungo jikulungwa jikupugaga nnitanda mula, mpaka mabhimbili ga mashi gugajinjile muntumbwi mula. Ikabheje a Yeshu bhashinkugona lugono. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhapite kwaajumuya bhalinkutinji, “Mmakulungwa, ntutapule, tunatitimila!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganya nkwetenje ngulupai jishoko, pakuti nnajogopanga?” Bhai gubhajimi, gubhajikalipile mbungo na mabhimbili gala, guitendile jii kwa kaje. <verse eid="MAT 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Bhandu bhala gubhalapilenje bhalinkutinji, “Bhenebha bhandu bhashi? Nkali mbungo na mabhimbili inakwaakunda!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaashoyanga Maoka Bhandu Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>A Yeshu bhakaisheje kung'ambu ku shilambo sha Bhagadala, gubhaimenenje bhandunji bhabhili bhakwetenje maoka bhalikoposhelanga kumakabhuli. Bhashinkujogoyanga na jwakwa mundu akombolaga kupita gwene mpandago. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Gubhatandwibhenje jobhela bhalinkutinji, “Nkutuloleya nndi mmwe Bhanabhabho a Nnungu? Bhuli, nshikwiya kutupoteka gakanabhe ika malanga gakwe?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Bhai, tome na penepo lyashinkupagwa likundi lya ngulubhe ilishungwa. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Bhai, ashimaoka bhala gubhaashondelesheyenje a Yeshu bhalinkutinji, “Ibhaga ntushoyaga, ntuleshe tukaajinjilanje ashingulubhe bhala.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>A Yeshu gubhalugulilenje, “Ayaga, nnjendangane.” Gubhaashoshileyenje bhandunji bhala, gubhapite kwaajinjilanga ashingulubhe. Likundi lyowe lya ngulubhe gulieleleshele nnitanda, guiwile yowe.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Ikabheje bhashunga bha ngulubhe ila gubhabhutukenje, gubhapitengene kunnjini. Kweneko gubhatalashiyenje ga ngulubhe ila na ga bhandunji bhakwetenje maoka bhala. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Kwa nneyo bhandunji bhowe pa shilambo pala gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu, bhakaabhonanjeje gubhaashondolesheyenje bhajabhule pa shilambo shabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunnamya Mundu jwa Poloka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maliko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>A Yeshu gubhakwelile muntumbwi, gubhajombweshe litanda gubhaishe kushilambo shabho. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Kweneko bhandu gubhaapeleshelenje mundu jumo apolweshe, agonile pa shinanda. A Yeshu bhakajibhoneje ngulupai jabhonji, gubhammalanjile mundu apolweshe jula, “Ambwiga! Mwiilume ntima, yambi yenu nneshelelwe.” <verse eid="MAT 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Bhaajiganya bha Shalia bhananji gubhaganishiyenje mmitima jabhonji kuti, “Bhene bhandubha bhanakwaakupulu a Nnungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>A Yeshu gubhaimanyi ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhashite, “Pakuti nnaganishiyanga ya nyata mmitima jenunji? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Shei shipepeshe, kubheleketa, ‘Uleshelelwe yambi yako,’ eu kubheleketa, ‘Jinuka ujende?’ <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Ikabheje, mmumanyanje kuti Mwana juka Mundu ashikola ukulungwa pa shilambolyo gwa kwaaleshelelanga bhandu yambi yabhonji.” Penepo gubhammalanjile mundu apolweshe jula, “Jinuka utole shinanda shako ujende kunngwako.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Bhai mundu apolweshe jula gwajimi, gwapite kunngwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Bhandu bhowe palugwinjili pala bhakaibhonanjeje yeneyo, gubhalapilenje na jogopa gubhaakushiyenje a Nnungu bhaapelenje bhandu gwene ukulungwago.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kushemwa kwa a Matei</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maliko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Na a Yeshu bhakajabhuleje penepo, gubhaabhweni bhandu bhamo lina lyabho a Matei, bhatemi nnyumba ja bhakamula koli. Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Nngagule.” Nabhalabho a Matei gubhajimi, gubhaakagwile.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>A Yeshu bhakatameje kumui kwa a Matei nkulya shalya, bhakamula koli bhabhagwinji na bhakwetenje yambi bhananji, gubhaikengenenje nitamanabhonji nkulya pamo na bhaajiganywa bhabho. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Ashimapalishayo bhakabhonanjeje nneyo, gubhabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Pakuti bhaajiganya bhenunji bhanalya shalya na bhakamula koli na bhakwetenje yambi?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Bhakotonji bhakakunnoleyanga mmitela, ikabheje bhakunnoleyanga mmitela bhalwelenji. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Bhai, nnjendangane nkaijiganyanje malombolelo ga gene malobhe gano, ‘Shingupinga shiya, nngabha mbepei.’ Nangaika kwaashemanga bhakwetenje aki, ikabheje bhakwetenje yambi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngani ja Tabha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maliko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Kungai bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana Bhabhatisha gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Uwe na Mapalishayo tunatabha. Pakuti bhaajiganywa bhenu bhakaatabhanga?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli, bhashemilwenje kundowa bhalipinjikwanga kwigutanjila bhalinginji naka nnyene nkulomba? Ikabheje shigaishile mobha nkulomba shashoywe, penepo shibhatabhanje.<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Jwakwa mundu atotela shibhamba sha ambi munngubho ja bhukala, pabha shibhambasho shishikwinyale nipunda pwengula nngubhojo. <verse eid="MAT 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>Wala bhandu bhakaataganga divai ja ambi mmipatila ja bhukala. Bhatendangaga nneyo, divaijo shijikwebhe nipapula mipatilajo na divai nijitika, ikabheje bhandu bhanataganga divai ja ambi mmipatila ja ambi, na yowe shiilonjeye ukoto.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunyuya Mwali na Lamya Bhakongwe Bhamo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maliko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>A Yeshu bhalinkubheleketa genego, a kalongolele bha Shiyaudi gubhaishe, nitindibhala bhalinkuti, “Mwali jwangu ashiwa nnainope, shonde ngunakunnjuga tulongane nkammishile nkono gwenu shalame.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>A Yeshu gubhajabhwile nikwaakagula pamo na bhaajiganywa bhabho.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Bhakongwe bhamo bhalwalaga shilwele sha nsholosholo yaka likumi limo na ibhili, gubhaakagwile a Yeshu shilinyuma, gubhakwashiye libhiniko lya nngubho jabho. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Bhashinkutenda nneyo pabha bhashinkwiibhalanjila bhayene, “Ngwayape nngubho jabho shiname.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhatendebhwishe nigubhaabhweni, gubhaabhalanjile, “Mwanangu, unakole lipamba! Ngulupai jako jikulamiye.” Bhakongwe bhala gubhalamile shilwele shabho shila malanga gala.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>A Yeshu bhakaisheje ku nyumba ja bhakulungwa bhala gubhaabhweninji bhaagombanga imbeta na bhandunji bhabhagwinji bhalinginji nshililo, <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nshokangane! Mwaliju jwanngawa, ikabheje ashigonape.” Nigubhaeshilenje kwa kaje. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Bhai, bhandunji bhala bhakashokangananjeje, a Yeshu gubhajinjile nkati, gubhankamwile nkono, mwali jula gwajimi nnyene. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Jene nganijo gujishumile nshilambo showe.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwalamyanga Ashinangalole Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>A Yeshu bhakajabhuleje penepo, ashinangalole bhabhili gubhaakagwilenje bhalijobhelanga, bhalinkutinji, “Mmaulongo gwa a Daudi, ntubhonele shiya.”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>A Yeshu bhakaisheje kumui, ashinangalole bhabhili bhala gubhaajendelenje, bhalabho gubhabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, nnikulupalilanga kuti ngunaakombola kunnamiyanga?” Nabhalabhonji gubhaajangwilenje, “Elo Mmakulungwa,” <verse eid="MAT 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhakwashiye meyo gabhonji, bhalinkuti, “Ibhe malinga shinshite kulupalilanga.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Meyo gabhonji gakubhalakukaga. Numbe a Yeshu gubhaakalipilenje, “Nnannugulilanje mundu jojowe genega.”<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Ikabheje gubhajabhwilenje, nishumya ngani ja a Yeshu nshilambo showe.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunshoya Lioka Mundu Aliji Bhubhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Na bhandunji pujabhulangaga, mundu jumo bhubhu akwete lioka, gwapelekwe kwa a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Shangupe akashoyweje lioka, mundu jula gwatandwibhe bheleketa. Bhandunji gubhalapilenje bhalinkutinji, “Yene indui tukanabhe kuibhona pa Ishilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Ikabheje Mapalishayo gubhashitenje, “Bhanashoya maoka kwa mashili gaka nkulungwa jwa maoka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabhonela Shiya Bhandunji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>A Yeshu bhatendaga owela ilambo yowe na ijiji yowe, bhalijiganya mmashinagogi na lunguya Ngani ja Mmbone ja Upalume gwa a Nnungu, na lamya ilwele yowe na kila ungakola mashili. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Bhai, bhakabhoneje lugwinjili lwa bhandu gubhaabhonelenje shiya, pabha bhashinkutotoshelanga na bhashinkukolanga lipamba malinga ngondolo yangali nshunga. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Penepo gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Maneng'eno gamagwinji, ikabheje bhakamula maengo bhashokope. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Bhai, mwaajuganje bhayene maneng'eno bhatume bhakamula maengo ku maneng'eno gabho.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatuma Likumi Limo na Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maliko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>A Yeshu gubhaashemilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho likumi limo na bhabhili, gubhaapelenje mashili ga shoya maoka na lamya ilwele na ungakola mashili gwa kila namuna. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Mena gabhonji mitume likumi limo na bhabhilibho ni gegano, bhantai a Shimoni bhashemwaga a Petili, na apwabho a Ndeleya, na a Yakobho na a Yowana bhana bha a Shebhedayo, na <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>a Pilipi na a Bhatolomeyo, na a Tomashi na a Matei bhakamula koli, na a Yakobho bhanabhabho a Alupayo, na a Tadei <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>na a Shimoni Bhakanaani, na a Yuda Ishikaliote bhaatendebhwishe a Yeshu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwatumanga Mitume Likumi Limo na Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maliko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>A Yeshu gubhaatumilenje mitume likumi limo na bhabhili bhala gubhaalajiyenje bhalinkuti, “Nnajendangane ku bhandu bhangabha Bhayaudi, wala nnajinjilanje mwiilambo ya Bhashamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Ikabhe nnjendangane ku bhandu bha Ishilaeli bhaobhilenje mbuti ngondolo. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Pushinnjendangane nnunguyanje nnei, ‘Upalume gwa Kunnungu ubhandishile.’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Nnamiyanje bhalwelenji, nnyuyanje bhawilenje na nnamyanje bhakwetenje mangundula na nshoyanje maoka. Nshipegwanga gwayoyo, nshoyanje gwayoyo. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Nnajigalanje mmbiya yoyowe mmiuko jenunji. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Nnajigalanje nng'uko mumpanda, wala lishati lya tingiganya, wala ilatu ya tindiganya, wala imbo. Pabha atenda maengo anapinjikwa alipwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Nnjinjilangaga nshilambo eu shijiji shoshowe, munnoleyanje mundu jwa pwaa na ntamangane kunngwakwe mpaka pushinjabhulanje. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Punkujinjilanga nnyumba, mwaajujilanje ulele. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Na ashaayene gwene muigo bhamposhelangaga, bhai ulele gwenunji shugwapwaanje, ikabheje bhakamposhelanje, ulele gwenunji shugummujilanje mmanganyanji. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Monaga mundu akanaga kumposhelanga eu kumpilikanilanga, bhai pushinshokanje jene nyumbajo eu shene shilambosho, nkung'undanje ndutuli mmakongono genunji ibhe shilangulo sha kwaaleyanga ga kana ntenga gwa a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, lyubha lya ukumu bhandunji bha shene shilambosho bhapinga patanga mboteko, kupunda yaapatilenje bhandunji bha ilambo ya Shodoma na Gomola.<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mboteko Ikwiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maliko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Nnolanje, ngunakuntumanga malinga ngondolo munkumbi gwa maogo, bhai nkolanje lunda malinga lijoka na mwiitimalikanje malinga ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Mwiiteiganje na bhandunji, pabha shibhanshitakiyanje kulukumbi na kunkomanga ibhoko mmashinagogi gabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Shimpelekwanje ku bhatagwala na bhapalume kwa ligongo lyangu nne, nkupinga nngong'ondelanje kunngwabhonji na kubhandunji bhangabha Bhayaudi. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Bhai, pushimpelekwanje ku bhaukumula, nnakolanje lipamba kuti shimmeleketanje nndi, pabha malanga gaishilaga shimpegwanje sha bheleketa. <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Pabha nngabha mmanganyanji shimmeleketanje, ikabhe Mbumu jwa Ainabhenunji a Nnungu abheleketa kupitila mmanganyanji.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Mundu shantendebhushe mpwakwe nkupinga abhulagwe na ainamundu shibhantendebhushe mwanagwabho na bhana shibhaatendebhukanje bhaakwetenje nikwaabhulaganga. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Bhandunji bhowe bhapinga kunshimanga mmanganya kwa ligongo lyangu nne. Ikabheje shaipililile mpaka kumpelo, shatapulwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>“Bhandu bhampotekangaga nshilambo shimo, mmutushilanje shilambo shina. Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nkamaliyanga ilambo yowe ya Ishilaeli Mwana juka Mundu akanabhe ika.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Nkujiganywa akakumpunda nkujiganya jwakwe, wala ntumwa akakwaapunda bhakulungwa bhakwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Inakomboleka bhaajiganywa kubha malinga bhaajiganya bhabho, naka ntumwa kubha malinga bhakulungwa bhakwe. Monaga bhaashemilenje bhayene nyumba Bhelishebhuli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bhelishebhuli lina lyakwe lina “Nkulungwa jwa maoka”</char></note>, shibhaashemanje mena ga nyata kaje bhandu bha nnyumba jabho.<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Apinjikwa Jogopwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Bhai, nnaajogopanje bhene bhandunjibho, pabha shoshowe shiunishilwe shipinga unukulwa, na shoshowe shiishwe shipinga undukulwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Lingummalanjilanga pa lubhindu, mmalanganje pashilangaya na limpilikenenje shinong'ona nnunguyanje palugwinjili. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Nnaajogopanje bhabhulaganga shiilupe, ikabheje bhakaakombolanga kuobhya mbumu, mbaya kwaajogopa bhakombola kuobhya shiilu na mbumu kumoto gwa ku Jeanamu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Ndyondyo ibhili ikaushwa kwa ela jimope? Ikabheje jwakwa nkali jumo agwa pai gwangali Ainabhenunji a Nnungu kumumanya, <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>ikabheje mmanganyanji, nkali umbo ya mmitwe jenunji ishibhalanganywa yowe. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Bhai nnajogopanje, mmanganyanji mmammbonenji kupunda ndyondyo yaigwinji.<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaapinga na Kwaakana a Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Mundu jojowe aangunda pa bhandu kuti jwangu, na nne shinyiye kunkong'ondela kwa Atati bhali kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Ikabheje jojowe shaangane pa bhandu, numbe nne shininkane kwa Atati bhali kunnungu.<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Malekano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Nnaganishiyaje kuti njikwiya peleka ulele pa shilambolyo, nngabha! Nangajiya peleka ulele ikabhe ngondo. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Pabha njikwiya kwaalekanyanga mundu na ainagwe, mwali na akwabhe, akwemundu na nkamwanagwabho, <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>ashaamagongo bhaka mundu, bhandu bha nnyumba jakwe.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Akwaapinga ainagwe eu akwabhe kupunda shaambinga nne, akakombola kubha nkujiganywa jwangu, wala akumpinga mwanagwe eu nabhiti jwakwe kupunda nne, akakombola kubha nkujiganywa jwangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Wala mundu akaujigale nshalabha gwakwe ningagula akakombola kubha nkujiganywa jwangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Mundu apinga kulama gwangali ngulupalila nne, akakola gumi gwa pitipiti, ikabheje shakunde bhulagwa kwa ligongo lya ngulupalila nne, shakole gumi gwa pitipiti.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Upo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maliko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Akumposhelanga mmanganya, anamboshela nne, na amboshela nne, anakwaposhela bhandumile bhala. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Akumposhela nkulondola jwa a Nnungu kwa ligongo lyabha nkulondola jwa a Nnungu, shaposhele upo ilandana na ika nkulondola jwa a Nnungu. Akumposhela akwete aki kwa ligongo lyabha akwete aki, shaposhele upo ilandana na ika akwete aki. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Na mundu jojowe shampe jumo jwa munkumbi gwa bhene bhashoko bhashokobha, kapela shikombe sha mashi gaima, pabha bhaajiganywa bhangu, kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, jwakwapi shalepele poshela upo yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Mitume Kopoka kwa a Yowana Bhabhatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje kwaalajiyanga bhaajiganywa bhabho likumi limo na bhabhili bhala, gubhajabhwilenje penepo, gubhapite jiganya na lunguya mwiilambo yabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>A Yowana bhabhatisha bhali bhatabhilwe kuligelesha gubhapilikene ga itendi ya a Yeshu Kilishitu. Bhai, a Yowana gubhaatumilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakaabhuyanje. <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>Gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mmwe ni bhakwiya bhala, eu twaalindile bhana?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Nnjendangane nkaalugulilanje a Yowana indu inkwipilikananga na inkwibhonanga, <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>ashinangalole bhanalolanga na ashinangwabha bhanakwendanga na bhakwetenje mangundula bhanalamanga na ashinangapilikane bhanapilikananga na bhawilenje bhanayukanga na bhaalaga bhanalungushiwanga Ngani ja Mmbone. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Mbaya mundu jojowe akalebha kwa ligongo lya leka ngulupalila nne.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Bhai, bhantenga bha a Yowana bhala bhalijabhulanga, a Yeshu gubhatandwibhe kwaabhalanjilanga makundi ga bhandu ngani ja a Yowana, “Mwashinkwendangana kuanga kulola nndi? Kulola litete lilitikinywa na mbungo? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Igala, mwapitengeneje kulola nndi? Mundu awete nngubho ya konja? Bhandu bhaawalanga nngubho ya konja mwaakutamanga nnyumba ya ashimpalume bha shilambo. <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Ikabheje, mwapiteneje lolanga nndi? Nkulondola jwa a Nnungu? Elo, ngunakummalanjilanga, mumweninji nkulungwa kupunda nkulondola jwa a Nnungu.<verse eid="MAT 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>“A Yowana ni bhantenga bhalugwilwe Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">‘Nnole, ngunakuntuma muntenga jwangu annongolele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:10">ashanng'alashiye mpanda gwenu.’<verse eid="MAT 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, akanabhe koposhela jwa nnibhondo ali jwankulungwa kwaapunda a Yowana bhabhatisha. Ikabheje, jwene ali jwanshoko Muupalume gwa Kunnungu, ni jwankulungwa kwaapunda bhenebho. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Tandubhila mobha ga a Yowana bhabhatisha mpaka nnaino, Upalume gwa Kunnungu gunakomanilwa na bhandunji bhanalinganga kuutola kwa mashili na bhakwetenje mashili bhanakuutolanga. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Pabha ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu bhowe na Shalia, mpaka mobha ga a Yowana, bhashinkulondolanga ga gene mobha gano. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Bhai, monaga shinkundanje, a Yowanabho ni a Eliya bhapinjikwaga bhaishe. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Akwete makutujo apilikane.<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Bhai, nandanye na nndi alu lubhelekolu? Malinga bhashanda bhatemingenenje kushoko, bhali kwaabhalanjilanga ashaajabhonji bhalinkutinji,<verse eid="MAT 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Twanngombelenje imbeta, ikabheje mwangainanga!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 11:17">Twajimbile nyimbo ya ililo, ikabheje mwangagutanga!’<verse eid="MAT 11:17"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Pabha a Yowana bhaishe, bhakaalya wala papila, gubhashitenje, ‘Bhashikola lioka.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Mwana juka Mundu gwaishe, alilya na papila, gubhashitenje, ‘Mwaalolanje bhaakongolela kulya na kolelwa, ashaambwiga ajabho bhakamula koli na bhakwetenje yambi!’ Nkali nneyo lunda lwa a Nnungu lumanyishe kuti lwammbone kwa itendi yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilambo Yangaipeta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhatandwibhe kwaagambanga bhandunji bha mwiilambo mubhatendile ilapo ya igwinji, pabha bhandu bhakwe bhangapinganga kwiipeta. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Ole gwenunji bhandu bha ku Kolashini! Ole gwenunji bhandu bha ku Bhetishaida! Pabha, ilapo itendeshe kungwenunji monaga ikatendeshe ku Tilo na ku Shidoni, bhandu bhabhonji bhakaipetilenje kwa wala maguniya na pakala liu kuti bhaleshilenje yambi. <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Ikabheje, ngunakummalanjilanga, lyubha lya ukumu mmanganya nkupinga patanga mboteko ya punda ya bhandunji bha ku Tilo na ku Shidoni. <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Na mmanganyanji bhandu bha ku Kapalanaumu, bhuli, shinkuywanje mpaka kunnungu? Nkupinga tuluywanga mpaka kundamo ja bhawilenje! Pabha, ilapo itendeshe kungwwenunji monaga ikatendeshe kubhandu bha ku Shodoma, shene shilambosho shikaapali mpaka lelo. <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Ikabheje ngunakummalanjilanga, lyubha lya ukumu mmanganyanji nkupinga patanga mboteko ya punda ya bhandu ku Shodoma.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nnjiyangane Kumpumulilanje</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Gene malangago a Yeshu gubhashite, “Ngunatenda eja kwenu mmwe Atati, Mmakulungwa bha kunnungu na pa shilambolyo, pabha yene indui nshikwaiyanga bhakwetenje lunda na bhaashomanga, nikwaunukulilanga bhana bhashoko bhashoko. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Elo Atati, pabha shiishite kunnonyela mmayene.”<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>Gubhaabhalanjilenje bhandunji, “Atati bhashingamuya indu yowe. Jwakwapi akummanya mwana ikabhe Atati, wala akwaamanya Atati ikabhe Mwana, na jojowe apingaga Mwana kung'unukulila.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Nnjiyangananje mmowe nkuabhukanga na topelwa na mishigo, nne shinimpumuliyanje. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Nkundanje kulongoywa na nne malinga ng'ombe atabhilwa lingongota, nkupinga mwiijiganyanje kwangu nne. Pabha nne najwakwiitimalika na najwashinunu, numbe mmanganyanji shimpumulilanje. <figure style="fig" alt="Yoke" file="NT-13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Ng'ombe Ibhili Itabhilwe Lingongota Ikalime Munngunda</figure> <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Pabha lingongota lyangu likaatona na nshigo gwangu ukaatopa.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Ga Lyubha lya Pumulila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maliko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Gene malangago, a Yeshu bhatendaga pita mmigunda ja ngano Lyubha lya Pumulila. Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhakwetenje shibhanga, gubhatandwibhenje kupulula maashe ga ngano, nitauna. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Mapalishayo bhakagabhonanjeje genego, gubhaalugulilenje a Yeshu, “Nnole, bhaajiganywa bhenu bhanatendanga indu ikapinjikwa tenda Lyubha lya Pumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli, nkanabhe shomanga ibhatendile a Daudi na ashaajabhonji pubhalinginji na shibhanga? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Shibhashite jinjila nnyumba ja a Nnungu gubhalile mikate jabhishilwe kwa ligongo lya a Nnungu jila. Pabha bhenebho nkali na ashaajabhonji bhakaapinjikwangaga kulya jene mikatejo, ikabhe bhaabhishilape. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Eu bhuli, nkanabhe shomanga nshitabhu sha Shalia ja a Musha kuti, puyakoposhelaga Lyubha lya Pumulila bhaabhishilanga bhatendaga lekanga kagula Shalia nniekalu, ikabheje bhakaganishiwanga kuti bhanalebhanga? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Bhai, ngunakummalanjilanga kuti pepano apali ali jwankulungwa kupunda liekalu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Kaliji nkamumanyinji malombolelo ga gene malobhe gano, ‘Shingupinga shiya nngabha mbepei,’ nkanaaukumulanje bhandunji bhangalebhanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Pabha, Mwana juka Mundu, ni nkulungwa jwa Lyubha lya Pumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mundu jwa Poloka Nkono</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maliko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>A Yeshu gubhashoshile penepo, gubhajinjile nshinagogi jabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Ashinkupagwa mundu akwete nkono upolweshe. Bhai, bhandu gubhaabhushiyenje a Yeshu, “Bhuli, ilipinjikwa kunamiya mundu Lyubha lya Pumulila?” Bhashinkwaabhuyanga nkupinga bhapatanje shiumilo sha kwaashitakia.<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Tujile mundu munkumbi gwenunji, ngondolo jwakwe atumbushilaga nniimbo, bhuli, akanshoya mwenemo pabha Lyubha lya Pumulila? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Na mundu ni jwa mana kupunda ngondolo! Bhai, shalia jetu jinakutupinga kutenda ya mmbone Lyubha lya Pumulila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Kungai gubhannugulile mundu jula, “Goloya nkono gwako.” Gwaugolweye, ukulamaga nibha malinga guna gula. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Ikabheje Ashimapalishayo gubhakopokenje palanga, gubhatendilenje nkungulu shanabhuli shibhaabhulaganje a Yeshu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumishi Aagwilwe na a Nnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>A Yeshu bhakagamanyeje genego, gubhajabhwile kweneko. Bhandu bhabhagwinji gubhaakagwilenje, nigubhaalamiyenje bhalwelenji bhowe, <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>gubhaamulishenje bhanannugulilanje mundu ga bhenebho, <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>nkupinga gamalile malobhe gubhabhelekete a Ishaya ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhalinkuti,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Nnole ntumishi jwangu juninng'agwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Jungumpinga anonyela muntima gwangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Shimishe Mbumu yangu muka jwenejo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Jwalakwe shalunguye ya aki ku bhandunji bhangabha Bhayaudi.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Akakola mitau wala kujobhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">Wala lilobhe lyakwe likapilikanika mmipanda.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Nnai upondeshe akautemanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Wala utambi ushoya lyoi akauima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">Mpaka pushatende ukumu jipinjikwa jitagwale.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Bhandu bhangabha Bhayaudi shibhalikulupalilanje lina lyakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Naka Bheelishebhuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maliko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Penepo bhandu gubhaapeleshelenje a Yeshu mundu jumo nangalole aliji bhubhu ligongo ashinkukola maoka. A Yeshu gubhanshoshiye lioka jula, gwakombwele kubheleketa na lola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Lugwinjili lowe gubhakanganigwenje bhalinkutinji, “Bhuli, pana jweneju Ulongo gwa a Daudi?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Ikabheje Mapalishayo bhakapilikananjeje genego, gubhashitenje, “Jwene munduju anashoya maoka kwa mashili gaka Bhelishebhuli, nkulungwa jwa maoka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>A Yeshu, bhakaimanyeje ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhaalugulilenje, upalume gogowe ugabhanikaga makundi nikanana, shiugwe, na shilambo eu likaja lyolyowe ligabhanikaga makundi nikanana, likalonjeya. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Ibhaga Lishetani anashoya maoka, bhai, upalume gwakwe shigulonjeye shanabhuli? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Mmanganya nkutinji ngunashoya maoka kwa mashili gaka Bhelishebhuli, bhuli, bhaakulupalila bhenunji bhanakwashoyanga kwa mashili gakeni? Kwa lyene ligongolyo bhanganyabho shibhanng'ukumulanje. <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Ikabheje monaga ngunashoya maoka kwa mashili ga Mbumu jwa a Nnungu, bhai, mmumanyanje kuti Upalume gwa a Nnungu ung'ishilenje.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Jwakwa mundu akombola kujinjila nnyumba jika mundu akwete mashili nikumpokonyola indu yakwe, gwangali tandubha kuntabha. Penepo shakombole kumpokonyola indu yakwe.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Jojowe akakwiilunda na nne, anangana, naka jojowe akalopola pamo na nne, anajaanganya. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Kwa lyene ligongolyo, ngunakummalanjilanga, bhandu shibhaleshelelwanje yambi yabhonji yowe, na matukano gowe, ikabheje ga kuntukana Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo bhakaleshelelwanga. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Na kabhili, abheleketa lilobhe lya kuntauka Mwana juka Mundu shaleshelelwe, ikabheje abheleketa lilobhe lya kuntauka Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, akaleshelelwa, wala nshilambolyo sha nnaino shino, wala shikwiyasho.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo na Iepo Yakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Nkongo ubhaga gwa mmbone na iepo yakwe shiibhe ya mmbone, na nkongo ubhaga gwangali gwa mmbone na iepo yakwe shiibhe yangali ya mmbone, pabha nkongo pukumanyika kwa iepo yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Mmanganya nninginji malinga majoka! Nkukombolanga bhuli kubheleketa indu ya mmbone nninginji mmangali bha mmbonenji? Pabha mundu yabheleketa ingumbele muntima gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Mundu jwa mmbone anatenda indu ya mmbone, pabha nshibhiko shakwe mushigumbala indu ya mmbone, ikabheje mundu jwa nyata ntima, anatenda indu ya nyata pabha ntima gwakwe ushigumbala indu ya nyata.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Bhai, ngunakummalanjilanga, lyubha lya ukumu bhandu bhapinga kwiya jangulanga ga malobhe gowe gangali ga mmbone gubhabheleketenje. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Pabha kwa malobhe genu shinnjiye bhoneka kuti nkwete aki, na kwa malobhe genu shinng'ukumulwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilangulo sha a Yona</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maliko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Penepo Mapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha Shalia bhananji gubhaalugulilenje a Yeshu, “Mmaajiganya, tunapinga tushibhone shilangulo kopoka kwenu mmwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Nabhalabho gubhaajangwilenje, “Alu lubhelekolu lwa lebha na lukakulupalika kwa a Nnungu! Nnapinganga shilangulo, nkapegwanga ikabheje shilangulo sha a Yona ankulondola bha a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Shibhashite tama a Yona mobha gatatu shilo na mui nnipitiu lika shamaki, nneyo peyo Mwana juka Mundu shatame mobha gatatu nnitaka shilo na mui. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Bhandu bha ku Ninawi shibhakoposhelanje mobha ga ukumu, nabhalabhonji shibhaluukumulanje alu lubhelekolu kuti lushilebha, pabha bhandu bha ku Ninawi bhaipetilenje kwa ligongo lya miungu ja a Yona, na mbena apano apali ali nkulungwa kupunda a Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>A Malikiya bha kwibhanda shibhakoposhele alu lubhelekolu pushiluukumulwe, na bhalabho shibhaluukumule kuti lushilebha, pabha bhenebho bhashinkukopoka kwa taliya, nkupinga bhapilikane malobhe ga lunda ga a Shelemani, na mbena apano apali ali nkulungwa kupunda a Shelemani.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubhuja kwa Lioka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Lioka anshokaga mundu, anatimbililatimbilila nng'anga nkuloleya pa pumulila na anapabhone. <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>Penepo anakwilugulila nnyene, ‘Shimuje kumui kungoposhele,’ ikabheje pabhuja nakupaimana pangali shindu, pali papyejilwe nikonjelewa, <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>shajende kwaatolanga ashimaoka bhananji shabha, bhajogoyanga kupunda jwenejo, na bhowe bhanakwiya kunjinjilanga mundujo. Na ali jika mundujo shijibhe jangali ja mmbone kupunda kundandubho. Na malinga shiipingabha kwa lubheleko lwa lebhalu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashaalongo Ajabhonji a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maliko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>A Yeshu bhali nkubheleketa na bhandu bhabhagwinji, anyinabhabho na ashaapwabho gubhaikengene nijimangana palanga, bhalipinganga kubheleketa nabho. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Bhai, mundu jumo gwabhalugulile, “Anyinabhenu na ashaapwenu pubhalinginji palanga, bhanapinganga kubheleketa na mmwe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaajangwile bhandu bhala, “A mama nne agani? Na ashapwanga nne ashigani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Kungai gubhaagolosheyenje nkono kwaalanguyanga bhaajiganywa bhabho, bhalinkuti, “Nnole abha ashaamama na ashaapwanga! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Pabha jojowe atenda yakupinga Atati bhali kunnungu, jwenejo ni mpwanga nne na nnumbwangu nne na a mama nne.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Nkupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maliko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Lyubha lyolyo, a Yeshu gubhajabhwile pamui pala, gubhapite tama nnyenje litanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Makundi gamakulungwa ga bhandu gashinkwaatimbilila mpaka a Yeshu gubhakwelile muntumbwi gubhatemi. Bhandu bhowe gubhajimingene nnyenje litanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Nabhalabho a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje indu yaigwinji kwa ndango, bhalinkuti, “Mpilikananje! Nkupanda ashinkwenda panda mmbeju.<verse eid="MAT 13:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>“Paliji nkumiya mmbeju, ina gwigwilile mumpanda, ijuni gwiishe nilya. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Ina gwigwilile pamaganga pangali litaka lyaligwinji. Gwiimelile shangupe pabha litaka likataliyeje, <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>lyubha likabhaleje, gwiinyalile, na pabha mbubhu yakwe yangajendeya gwiijumwile. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Ina gwigwilile pa mikongo ja mibha, na jalakwe gujikulile niutalila. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Ina gwigwilile pa litaka lya mmbone, gwiimelile, gwiiogwele ina makumi kumi na ina makumi shita na ina makumi gatatu. <verse eid="MAT 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Akwete makutujo na apilikane!”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ligongo lya Bheleketa kwa Ndango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maliko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje nikwaabhuya, “Pakuti nnabheleketa na bhandunji kwa ndango?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Mmanganya nshijaliwanga kwiimanya indu ya nng'iyo ya Upalume gwa Kunnungu, ikabheje bhanganyanjibho bhangajaliwanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Pabha akwete shindu apinga pegwa na jenjeshewa, ikabheje jwangali shindu, nkali shakwete shila, shipinga tolwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Ngunabheleketa nabhonji kwa ndango, pabha bhanalolanga ikabheje shakwa shibhakushibhonanga, bhanapilikanilanga ikabheje bhakapilikananga, wala bhakaelewanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Gatimilile gubhabhelekete ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Ishaya ga kuti, Bhakulungwa bhaashite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kupilikana shimpilikananje, ikabheje nkaelewanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">Nkupinga lolanga, ikabheje nkashibhonanga shindu<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Pabha mitima ja bhene bhandunjibha jishitopa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Bhashiibhanga makutu gabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Bhashikupilanga meyo gabhonji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Gwangali nneyo, bhakalolilenje na meyo gabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Bhakapilikenenje na makutu gabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Bhakaelewenje mmitima jabhonji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Bhakandendebhushilenje, bhashite Bhakulungwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">ngaalamiyenje.’<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>“Ikabheje mbaya mmanganyanji, pabha meyo genunji ganalola na makutu genunji ganapilikana. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu na bhandunji bha aki bhabhagwinji bhashinkulokolilanga kugabhona gunkugabhonangaga, bhanagabhonanje, na pilikana gunkupilikanangaga, bhanagapilikananje.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malombolelo ga Lutango lwa Nkupanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maliko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Bhai, mmanganya mpilikananje lutango luka nkupanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Jojowe akulipilikana lilobhe lya Upalume gwa Kunnungu gwangali kulielewa, pali malinga mmbeju igwilile mumpanda ila, na Lishetani anakwiyatola shipandilwe muntima gwakwe shila. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Mmbeju jipandilwe pa liganga jila jinalandana naka mundu akulipilikana lilobhe lya a Nnungu, shangupe anakuliposhela nikwiinonyela, <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>ikabheje akakulibhika muntima gwakwe nilonjeya, na pushiika shilaje kwa ligongo lya lyene lilobhelyo, shangupe anatenguka. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Mmbeju jigwilile pa mikongo ja mibha, inalandalana naka mundu akulipilikana lyene lilobhelyo, ikabheje ga lipamba lya shilambolyo shino na ga pinga kola indu inautalila lilobhelyo, na lyalakwe likaogoya iepo. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Mmbeju jipandilwe nnitaka lya mmbone jinalandana naka mundu akulipilikana lyene lilobhelyo na kulielewa, na jwalakwe malinga mmbeju iogoya iepo, jimo makumi kumi na jina makumi shita na jina makumi gatatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Likonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhandunji lutango luna, “Upalume gwa Kunnungu ushilandana naka mundu apandile mmbeju ya mmbone mungunda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Ikabheje bhandu bhalibhagonilenje, mmagongo nnjabho gwaishe, gwapandile likonde mungunda gwabho gwa ngano, gwaijabhulile. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Bhai, ngano ikameleje na tandubha tumbuka, likonde nalyalakwe gulikulile. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Bhatumishi bha bhayene nngunda bhala gubhaajendelenje, nikwaalugulila, ‘Mmakulungwa, imwapandile mmbeju ya mmbone mungunda gwenu. Igala nnaino likonde kulikopweshe kwei?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Nabhalabho gubhaajangwilenje, ‘Amagongo ajangu bhatendile nneyo.’ Bhai, bhatumishi bhabho gubhaabhushiyenje, ‘Bhuli nnipinga tujende tukatutumbule?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Nabhalabho gubhaajangwilenje, ‘Nngabha, inabha pushintutumbulanje likonde nnatutumbulanga na ngano. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Nnekanje yowe ikule pamo mpaka mobha ga maneng'eno. Gene mobhago shinaalugulilanje bhaunanga, nkumbililanje likonde mmatuto nijoka. Ikabheje ngano nnopolanje nkabhikanje mungokwe jangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Mmbeju ja Aladali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maliko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhandunji lutango luna, “Upalume gwa Kunnungu unalandana na mmbeju ja aladali jatolile mundu jumo, gwapandile mungunda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Mmbeju jene jajishoko kupunda mmbeju yowe, ikabheje jimelaga jinakula nipunda yalya yowe munngunda, nibha malinga nkongo gwankulungwa, nkali ijuni inakwiyashenga maui nnyambi yakwe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ngedule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>A Yeshu gubhaabalanjilenje lutango luna, “Upalume gwa Kunnugu ushilandana na ngedule jibhatolile bhakongwe bhamo, gwaangenye na utandi madebhe gabhili na nushu, utandi gowe guumwishe.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubheleketa kwa Ndango</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maliko 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>A Yeshu bhashinkwaalugulilanga bhandu gene gowego kwa ndango. Bhangaalugulilanga shindu shoshowe gwangali ndango, <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>nkupinga litimilile lyelila, lyalugwilwe na ankulondola bha a Nnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Shimelekete nabhonji kwa ndango</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Shing'unukule gaishiywe tandubhila kupanganywa kwa shilambolyo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatalashiya ga Lutango lwa Likonde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaalajilenje bhandunji bhala, gubhajinjile nnyumba. Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nntulugulile ukoto ga lutango lwa likonde munngunda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Apanda mmbeju ya mmbone ila, Mwana juka Mundu, <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Nngunda gula shilambolyo. Mmbeju ya mmbone ila, bhandunji bhalinginji Muupalume gwa Kunnungu. Ikabheje likonde lila bhandunji bhaka Lishetani. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Mmagongo apandile likonde lila ni Lishetani. Mauno, mpelo gwa shilambolyo na bhaunanga, ashimalaika. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Malinga makonde shigakuti kumbililwa nijokwa moto, pushijiyebha lyubha lya mpelo gwa shilambolyo. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Mwana juka Mundu apinga kwatumanga ashimalaika bhakwe bhakaalopolanje koposhela Muupalume gwabho bhowenji bhalinginji shiumilo sha bhandu kutenda yambi, na bhowe bhaatendanga ya nyata. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Nikwaaleshelanga nnishembo lya moto, kweneko bhapinga gutanga na tauna meno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Kungai, bhanguja bhala bhapinga ng'anyimanga mbuti lyubha Muupalume gwa Ainabhabhonji. Akwete makutujo na apilikane!<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Shibhiko Shiishiywe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Upalume gwa Kunnungu unalandana na shibhiko shiishiwe munngunda. Mundu jumo gwashibhweni, gwashiishiye kabhili. Ashinkuangalala kwa kaje, gwapite kuusha yowe yakwete, gwaumile nngunda gula.<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Kabhili, Upalume gwa Kunnungu unalandana naka mundu jumo ausha indu, nkuloleya liganga lya konja lya mmbiya yaigwinji lishemwa lulu. <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>Akajibhoneje lulu jimo ja mmbiya yaigwinji, gwapite usha yowe yaakwete, gwaumile lulu jila.<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Lyau lya Yamaki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Kabhili, Upalume gwa Kunnungu unalandana na lyau litejilwe mmashi, yamaki ya kila namuna gwiitanjile. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Lyau lila likagumbaleje, bhandunji gubhautilenje kunyenje bhaali, gubhatemingenenje, gubhaagwilenje yamaki ya mmbone gubhatajilenje mwiikapu yabhonji na yangali ya mmbone gubhaijailenje. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Nneyo pushijiyebha kumpelo gwa shilambolyo, shibhakoposhelanje ashimalaika, bhapinga agulanya bhandunji, bhangali bha mmbone na bhakwetenje aki, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>na kwaleshelanga pa moto bhangali bha mmbonebho. Kweneko shibhagutanje na tauna meno.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shibhiko sha Ambi na sha Bhukala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, nngaelewenje gene gowego?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Elo.” <verse eid="MAT 13:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Nabhalabho gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Bhai nneyo, kila bhaajiganya bha Shalia bhajigenywe ga Upalume gwa Kunnungu, bhanalandana na bhayene nyumba bhashoya nshibhiko shabho indu ya ambi na ya bhukala.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakanwa ku Nashaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maliko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje kubheleketa ndango yoweyo gubhaijabhulile, <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>gubhapite kushijiji shabho ku Nashaleti. Kweneko gubhaajigenyenje bhandunji nshinagogi jabhonji, mpaka gubhakanganigwenje, gubhashitenje, “Jweneju kwapatile kwei lwene lunda na mashili ga tenda yene ilapoi? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Bhuli, jweneju nngabha mwanagwabho apundi shelemala bhala? Bhuli, akwabhe nngabha a Malia na ashapwakwe nngabha a Yakobho na a Yoshepu na a Shimoni na a Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Bhuli, ashalumbugwe, bhowe nngabha tulitama nabhonji pano? Bhai, kwapatile kwei gene gowega?”<verse eid="MAT 13:56"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Bhai, gubhaashimilenje. Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nkulondola jwa a Nnungu akalepela kukuywa, ikabheje pa shilambo shakwe na kunngwakwe!” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Kwa nneyo, bhangatenda ilapo yaigwinji pepala kwa ligongo lya ungakulupalila gwabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwa a Yowana Bhabhatisha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maliko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Gene mobhago a mpalume Elode gubhapilikene ngani ja a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>Bhai, gubhaalugulilenje bhatumishi bhabho, “Bhenebha a Yowana bhabhatisha bhashiyuka, pabha mashili gabho ganatenda ilapo.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Pabha a Elode bhashinkwaakamula a Yowana, nikwatabha kuligelesha kwa ligongo lya a Elodia, akongobhabho a Pilipi, apwabho. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Pabha a Yowana bhashinkwaalugulila a Elode “Nngabha alali mmwe kwaalomba bhene bhakongwebho!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>A Elode bhashinkupinga kwaabhulaga a Yowana, ikabheje bhashikwaajogopanga bhandunji, pabha bhamumanyinji kuti, a Yowana ankulondola bha a Nnungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Lyubha lya shikukuu sha bhelekwa kwabho a Elode, mwali jwabho a Elodia ashinkuina pa bhajeninji. A Elode guyaanonyele, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>mpaka gubhalumbile kumpa mwalijo shoshowe shapinga juga.<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Najwalakwe, akuno ajigenywe na akwabhe, gwashite, “Mmbe nnainope nshipeta, ntwe gwa a Yowana bhabhatisha.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>A Elode gubhainjishe, ikabheje kwa ligongo lya lumbila kwabho na ga bhajeninji, gubhaamulishe apegwe. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Bhai, a Elode gubhantumile mundu kuligelesha akaakate ntwe a Yowana. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Ntwe gwabho guuishe guli nshiniya, gubhampele mwali jula, najwalakwe akwaapaga akwabhe. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Bhaajiganywa bha a Yowana gubhaikengenenje, gubhatolilenje maiti gala, gubhashishilenje. Kungai gubhapite kwaabhalanjilanga a Yeshu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaaliyanga Bhanabhalume Elupu Nng'ano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maliko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yowana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>A Yeshu bhakapilikaneje ngani ja a Yowanajo, gubhajabhwile pepala na ntumbwi, gubhapite kujika kwangali bhandu. Ikabheje bhandu gubhamumanyinji, gubhaakagwilenje na makongono kukoposhela mwiilambo yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Bhai, bhakaisheje kumbwani gubhaluweni lugwinjili lwa bhandu, gubhaabhonelenje shiya, gubhaalamiyenje bhalwele bhabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Ligulo, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje gubhaalugulilenje, “Putuli pano pa anga na ligulo liishe. Bhai, mwaalajilanje bhandunji bhajendangane kushijiji bhakaiumilanje shalya.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Ikapinjikwa bhajendangane, mmanganyanji mwaapanganje shalya.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Na bhalabhonji gubhaalugulilenje, “Jitukwete mikate nng'anope na yamaki ibhili.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmbanganje yowe akuno.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Gubhaamulishe bhandu bhatamangane mmanyai. Kungai a Yeshu gubhatolile mikate nng'ano jila na yamaki ibhili ila, gubhalolile kunnungu, gubhaatendele eja a Nnungu. Kungai gubhagebhenye mikate jila, gubhaapelenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, na bhalabhonji gubhaapelenje bhandunji. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Bhandu bhowe gubhalilenje, nijukuta. Kungai bhaajiganywa gubhakundikenyenje malepei gala, gubhagumbeyenje ikapu yaishoko likumi limo na ibhili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Bhandu bhalilenje bhala pubhalinginji bhanabhalume elupu nng'ano, gwangali kwabhalanganishiyanga bhanabhakongwe na bhana.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaowa Pantundu Mashi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maliko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yowana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Shangupe, a Yeshu gubhaamulishenje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakwelanje muntumbwi, bhalongolelanje jomboka litanda akuno bhalikwaalajilanga bhandunji. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Bhakaalajilanjeje bhandunji, gubhakwelile kushitumbi jikape kujuga Nnungu. Lyene ligulolyo pubhaliji jikape kweneko, <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>na gene malangago ntumbwi gula pugwaliji tome pakati pakati litanda, ikabheje gwatendaga komwa na mabhimbili pabha mbungo jatendaga puga kopoka mmujo jabhonji.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Shilo, tome na kumashelo, a Yeshu gubhaajendelenje bhaajiganywa bhalikwenda panani mashi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhaakabhonanjeje bhalikwenda pantundu mashi gubhajogopenje kwa kaje, gubhashitenje, “Lioka!” Gubhajobhelenje bhalijogopanga.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Shangupe, a Yeshu gubhabhelekete nabhonji, “Mwiilumanje ntima, ni nne. Nnajogopanje!” <verse eid="MAT 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>A Petili gubhaalugulile, “Mmakulungwa, ibhaga kweli mmwe, nnugulile nyiye kweneko pantundu mashi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Ayaga, nnjiye.” A Petili gubhatulwishe muntumbwi mula gubhatandwibhe kwenda panani mashi, bhalikwaajendela a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Ikabheje bhakajibhoneje mbungo jila, bhakujogopaga, gubhatandwibhe titimila, gubhagutile nguto, “Mmakulungwa, nndapule!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhagolweye nkono gwabho, gubhaakamwile nikwaalugulila, “Mmwe nkwete ngulupai jishoko! Pakuti mwangakulupalila malobhe gangu?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Kungai gubhakwelilenje muntumbwi mula, na mbungo jila jikupumulaga. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Bhowe bhalinginji muntumbwi mula guhaatindibhalilenje, bhalinkutinji, “Kweli mmwe ni Bhanabho a Nnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalamya Bhalwelenji ku Geneshaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maliko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Gubhajombokenje litanda, gubhaikengenenje kushilambo sha Geneshaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Bhandunji bha kwekula bhakamumanyanjeje, gubhashumiyenje nganijo mmbali yowe. Bhai gubhaapeleshelenje a Yeshu bhalwelenji bhowe, <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>gubhaashondelesheyenje bhaalekanje bhaakwayanje nkali libhiniko lya ngubho jabho. Na bhowe bhaakwashiyenje gubhalamilenje.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Ikubho ya Bhanyikala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maliko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Kungai Mapalishayo na bhaajiganya bha Shalia gubhaikengenenje koposhela ku Yelushalemu, gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu, nikwaabhuya, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Pakuti bhaajiganywa bhenu bhakakamulanga ikubho itujigenywe na bhanangulungwa bhetu? Bhakaanabhanga makono ukoto pa shalya.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Pakuti numbe mmanganyanji nnalekanga Shalia ja a Nnungu, nikagulila ikubho yenunji? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>A Nnungu bhaashite, ‘Gwaajogope ainago na akwenu, pabha ishijandikwa, akwaatukana ainagwe eu akwabhe, abhulagwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Ikabheje mmanganya nnajiganyanga kuti mundu abhaga na shindu shakwaapa ainagwe eu akwabhe, ikabheje ashibheleketa, ‘Shene shindushi njikwaapa a Nnungu,’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>bhai, akapinjikwa kabhili kwaajogopa ainagwe nikwaapa! Nnei shinkuti kulinyegeyanga lilobhe lya a Nnungu nkukagula ikubho yenunji. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Mmanganya mmagulumba! A Ishaya bhalondwele ukoto genu mmanganya.”<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>A Nnungu bhanabheleketa, “ ‘Bhene bhandunjibha bhananyogopanga kwa malobhepe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">Ikabheje mitima jabhonji jishitalikangana na nne.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Kundindibhalila kwabhonji kwayoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">Pabha majiganyo gabhonji ni malajilo ga shigundupe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Indu Ikuntenda Mundu Anyate</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maliko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>A Yeshu gubhaashemilenje bhandu bhagumbelenje bhala, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mpilikananje, na mmumanyanje! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Shindu shalya mundu shikakuntenda mundu anyate, ikabhe malobhe gakopoka nkang'wa, ni gakuntenda mundu anyate.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Kungai bhaajiganywa gubhaajendelenje, nikwaabhuya, “Bhuli, mmumanyi kuti Mapalishayo bhashinkutumbalanga bhakapilikananjeje malobhe genu?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Litepo lyolyowe lyangapandwa na Atati bha kunnungu, lipingatutumbulwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Mwaalekanje bhanganyabho, ashikalongolele nangalole. Nangalole annongoyaga nangalole mwine, bhowe bhanaabhili shibhatumbushilanje nniimbo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>A Petili gubhashite, “Nntulugulile ukoto ga lutango.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Nkali mmanganya mpaka nnaino nkanabhe kumumanyanga? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Bhuli, nkakumumanyanga kuti shoshowe shijinjila nkang'wa shinakwenda nnipitiu na kungai shinaepukwa kulilindi? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Ikabheje malobhe gakopoka nkang'wa mugakoposhele muntima, na genego ni gakuntenda mundu anyate. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Pabha muntima inakoposhela ng'aniyo ya nyata, kubhulaga na labhalabha na gwii na kong'ondela unami na matukano. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Genego ni gakuntenda mundu anyate. Ikabheje kulya shalya gwangali nabha makono kukakuntenda mundu anyate.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngulupai ja Bhakongwe Bhamo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maliko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>A Yeshu gubhajabhwile pepala gubhapite tama mmbali ja ku Tilo na ku Shidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Bhai, bhakongwe bhamo Bhakanaani bha shene shilambosho gubhaaishile, gubhautiye lilobhe bhalinkuti, “Mmakulungwa, Bhaulongo gwa a Daudi, mmonele shiya! Mwali jwangu analaga kaje lioka.” <verse eid="MAT 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu bhangaajangula. Bhai, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje, nikwaabhalanjila, “Mwaalugulile bhajabhule, pabha bhanakutukagula bhalijobhela.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Nangatumwa ikabhe kubhandu bha ku Ishilaeli bhalinginji malinga ngondolo iobhile.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Penepo bhakongwe bhala gubhaatindibhalile, bhalinkuti, “Mmakulungwa, nnjiye kunnyangutile.”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Nngabha mmbone tola shalya sha bhana nikwiijaila mbwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Bhakongwe bhala gubhashite, “Kweli, Mmakulungwa, ikabheje nkali mbwa inalya malepeyo gagwa pa mesha ya ashinangologwe.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Mama, ngulupai jenu jikulungwa, bhai, ntendelwe malinga shinkupinga.” Lioka jula akunshokaga mwali jula, nigwalamile malanga gala.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalamya Bhandu Bhabhagwinji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>A Yeshu gubhashoshile pepala gubhapite nnyenje litanda lya Galilaya, gubhajombweshe ku shitumbi, nigubhatemi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinji gubhaaishilenje bhalikwaapeleshelanga bhalemelenje na ashinangalole na ashinangwabha na bhubhu na bhalwelenji bhabhagwinji, gubhaabhishilenje mmujo jabho, nabhalabho a Yeshu gubhaalamiyenje. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Lugwinjili lwa bhandu lula lwashinkulapa bhakaabhonanjeje ashibhubhu bhalibheleketanga, bhalemelenje bhalamilenje, ashinangwabha bhalijimajimanga, na ashinangalole bhalilolanga, bhandu gubhaainiyenje a Nnungu bha Ishilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaaliyanga Shalya Bhandu Elupu Nsheshe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maliko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaashemilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, gubhashite, “Ngunakwaabhonelanga shiya bhandunjibha, pabha bhashitamangana na nne mobha gatatu, nnaino bhangalinginji shalya. Ngapinga kwaalekanga bhajabhulangane gwangali kulya shalya, bhanaondokanga mumpanda.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaalugulilenje, “Putulipano paanga, shitupate kwei shalya sha jukuta bhandu bhabhagwinji nnei?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mikate jilingwa jinkwetenje?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Shabha na yamaki ishokope.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaamulishenje bhandu bhatamangane pai. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Gubhatolile mikate shabha jila na yamaki ila, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu, gubhagebhenye, gubhaapelenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, na bhalabhonji gubhaagabhanishiyenje bhandunji. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Bhowe gubhalilenje nijukuta. Kungai gubhakundikenyenje malepei, gubhagumbeyenje ikapu shabha yaikulungwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Bhalilenjebho pubhalinginji bhanabhalume elupu nsheshe, gwangali kubhalanganishiya bhanabhakongwe na bhana.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaalajilenje bhandunji, gubhakwelile muntumbwi, gubhapite mmbali ja ku Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Bhandu Bhanapinganga Ilangulo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maliko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Mapalishayo na Mashadukayo gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu, bhalikwaatejelanga, gubhaajujilenje bhaatendelanje shilangulo kopoka kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Shiikaga shigulogulo mmanganya nkutinji, ‘Malabhi kupingasha ukoto pabha liunde lishishejela!’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Kulisha nkutinji, ‘Lelo kukasha ukoto mbungo jipinga puga, pabha liunde lishishejela na maunde gashibhindula!’ Bhai, mmanganya nnamanyililanga kujimanya miongwe kwa lola liunde, ikabheje nkakwimanyanga ilangulo ya jene miongwe jino? <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Lubheleko lwa lebha na lukakulupalika kwa a Nnungu! Nnapinganga shilangulo, ikabheje lukapegwa shilangulo shoshowe ikabhe shilangulo sha a Yona.” Bhai, gubhaaleshilenje, nigubhaijabhulile.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngedule ya Mapalishayo na Mashadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maliko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakajombokanjeje ng'ambu jabhili ja litanda, gubhang'amulenje kuti bhashilibhalanga kujigala mikate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mwilolesheyanje na mwiteiganje na ngedule ya Mapalishayo na Mashadukayo!”<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Ikabheje bhalabhonji gubhataukengenenje ashayenenji, “Bhanabheleketa nneyo pabha twangajigala mikate.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>A Yeshu gubhaimanyi ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganya mmandunji bha ngulupai jishoko! Pakuti nnabheleketanga ga ligongo lya ngajigala mikate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Bhuli, nkanabhe ng'amulanga? Bhuli, nkaakumbushilanga punagebhenye mikate nng'ano jila kwa bhanabhalume elupu nng'ano? Bhuli ikapu yaishoko ilingwa imwagumbeyenje ya malepei? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Eu, mikate shabha jila jibhagabhanishiywenje bhanabhalume elupu nsheshe, bhuli, imwakundikenyenje ikapu yaikulungwa ilingwa ya malepei? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Pakuti nkang'amulanga kuti ngabheleketaga ga mikate? Ikabheje mwiteiganje na ngedule ya Mapalishayo na Mashadukayo!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Penepo bhaajiganywa gubhamumanyinji kuti bhashikwaalugulilanga bhaiteiganje nngabha na ngedule ya mmikate, ikabheje bhaiteiganje na majiganyo ga Mapalishayo na Mashadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Petili Bhanakwaakong'ondela a Yeshu Kuti a Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maliko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>A Yeshu bhakaisheje mmbali ja ku Kaishalia Pilipi, gubhaabhushiyenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Bhandu bhakutinji Mwana juka Mundu ni gani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhananji bhakutinji a Yowana Bhabhatisha, bhananji a Eliya, bhananji a Yelemia, eu jumo munkumbi gwa ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Na mmanganyanji bhuli, nkutinji nne gani?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>A Shimoni Petili gubhajangwile, “Mmwe a Kilishitu, Bhanabhabho a Nnungu, bhali bhabhakoto.” <verse eid="MAT 16:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Mbaya mmwe a Shimoni bhanabhabho a Yona, pabha nngabha mundu anng'ibhulile yenei, ikabhe Atati bhali kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Nne ngunakunnugulila mmwe a Petili, mmwe lindandawe na panani lindandawe ngupinga shenga likanisha lyangu, wala mashili ga kundamo ja bhawilenje gakalikombola. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Shinimpe punguo ya Upalume gwa Kunnungu, shoshowe shishintabhe pa shilambolyo, shishitabhwe kunnungu na shoshowe shishinngopole pa shilambolyo, shishigopolwe kunnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Kungai gubhaalimbiyenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, bhanannugulilanje mundu jojowe kuti bhenebho a Kilishitu.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabheleketa ga Potekwa Nawa Kwabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maliko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Tandubhila gene malangago a Yeshu gubhatandwibhe kwaalugulilanga bhaajiganywa bhabho gwangali nng'iyo kuti bhanapinjikwa kwenda ku Yelushalemu, na kweneko bhapinga potekwa na bhanangulungwa na bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha Shalia. Kuti, bhapinga bhulagwa na lyubha lya tatu shibhayuywe.<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>A Petili gubhaatolile kuntemela, gubhatandwibhe kwaakalipila, “Inabhe nneyo Mmakulungwa! Lyeneli likankoposhela!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhatendebhwishe, gubhaalugulile a Petili, “Nnyabhulile apano, Lishetani! Mmwe nnang'ibhilila. Ng'aniyo yenu nngabha ya a Nnungu ikabhe ya shigundu!”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Mundu jojowe apinga ngagula nne, anapinjikwa aikane nnyene, ajigale nshalabha gwakwe angagule. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Pabha, mundu apinga kulama gwangali ngulupalila nne, akakola gumi gwa pitipiti, ikabheje shakunde bhulagwa kwa ligongo lya ngulupalila nne, shakole gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Mundu shiimpwaile nndi apataga indu yowe ya pa shilambolyo na akuno aliobhya gumi gwakwe gwa pitipiti? Eu, mundu shashoye shindu shashi pa gumi gwakwe gwa pitipiti? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Pabha, Mwana juka Mundu shaishe na ukonjelo gwa Ainagwe pamo na ashimalaika bhakwe, penepo shannipe kila mundu malinga shashite tenda. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, bhapalinji bhananji pepano bhakawanganga bhakanabhe kummonanga Mwana juka Mundu alikwiiya malinga Mpalume.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanapindikuka Lubhombo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maliko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Gakapiteje mobha shita, a Yeshu gubhaatolilenje a Petili na a Yakobho na a Yowana apwabho, gubhajombokenje ku shitumbi shashileu. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Kweneko, a Yeshu gubhapindikwishe lubhombo pa meyo gabhonji, kumeyo kwabho kwashinkung'anyima malinga lyubha na nngubho yabho puyaliji yanawe malinga shilangaya. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>A Musha na a Eliya gubhaakoposhelenje, gubhalinginji nkubheleketa na a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Penepo a Petili gubhaalugulile a Yeshu, “Mmakulungwa, shankonja uwe kubha apano! Mpingaga shinjenje mabhanda gatatu, limo lyenu na lina lya a Musha na lina lya a Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Pubhaliji nkubheleketa nneyo, liunde lya nawe likwaaunishilangaga, lilobhe gulipilkanishe koposhela nniundemo, “Jweneju ni mwanangu jungumpinga, anonyela, mumpilikanilanje.” <verse eid="MAT 17:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Bhaajiganywa bhakapilikananjeje nneyo gubhagwilenje namanguku, gubhajogopenje kaje. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>A Yeshu gubhaajendelenje, nikwaakwayanga, gubhashite, “Nnjimangane, nnajogopanje!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Bhakalolanjeje kunani bhangammonanga mundu juna, ikabhe a Yeshu jikape.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Bhai, pubhalinginji bhalielelanga kopoka kushitumbi, a Yeshu gubhaalimbiyenje bhalinkuti, “Nnannugulilanje mundu indu imwiibhweninji, mpaka Mwana juka Mundu pashayuywe.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Kungai bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaabhushiyenje, “Pakuti bhaajiganya bha Shalia bhakutinji inapinjikwa bhatandubhe kuika a Eliya?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Kweli, a Eliya shibhaishe kualaya indu yowe. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Ikabheje ngunakummalanjilanga, a Eliya bhaaishe bhanganyabho bhangaamanyanga, ikabhe bhashinkwaatendelanga mwaapinjilenje. Nneyo peyo mwana juka Mundu apinga potekwa mmakono gabhonji.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Penepo bhaajiganywa bhala gubhamumanyinji kuti bhatendaga kwaabhalanjilanga ga a Yowana Bhabhatisha.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakunshoya Lioka Nshanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maliko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Bhakaikangananjeje ku bhandu bhagumbelenje bhala, bhandu bhamo gubhaajendele a Yeshu, nikwaatindibhalila, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>gubhashite, “Mmakulungwa, mummonele shiya mwanangu ashikola shialala, numbe analaga kaje, papagwinji anagwila pa moto eu mmashi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Nashinkumpeleka kubhaajiganywa bhenu ikabheje bhangakombolanga kunshoya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Alu lubheleko lwangali ngulupai na lwa puganika! Shindame na mmanganya mpaka shakani? Shinikakatimile na mmanganya mpaka shakani? Munnjiyenajonji akuno mwanajo,” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhankalipile liokajo, nigwanshoshile mwana jula, gwalamile malanga gala.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Kungai bhaajiganywa gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu shintemela, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Pakuti uwe twangakombola kunshoya lioka jula?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Kwa ligongo lya ungakulupalila gwenunji. Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, ibhaga shinkolanje ngulupai, nkali jajishoko malinga mbeju ja aladali, shinkombolanje kushilugulila nkali ashi shitumbishi, ‘Shokapa ujende akula,’ shishijende. Shakwa shoshowe shikaakomboleka kungwenunji.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Ikabheje lioka jwa nnei akashoka ila kwa tabha na juga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana ga bhukala gangali gwene nshitaligu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabheleketa Kabhili Gawa na Yuka Kwabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maliko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Pubhalinginji pamo ku Galilaya, a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Mwana juka Mundu apinga kamuywa ku bhandunji. <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>Bhapinga kummulaganga, ikabheje lyubha lya tatu shayuywe.” Bhaajiganywa gubhainjikenje kaje.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kulipa Koli ja Liekalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>A Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakaikanganeje ku Kapalanaumu, bhakamula koli ja liekalu bhala gubhaajendelenje a Petili, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhuli, bhaajiganya bhenunji bhalilipa koli ja Liekalu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>A Petili gubhajangwile, “Elo, bhalilipa.” Bhai a Petili bhakajinjileje nnyumba, bhakanabhe bheleketa lilobhe, a Yeshu gubhaabhushiye, “A Shimoni, mmwe nkubhona bhuli? Ashimpalume bha shilambolyo bhanalonganga koli kwa ashigani? Kwa ashaayene shilambo eu ku bhajeninji?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>A Petili gubhajangwile, “Kopoka ku bhajeninji.” A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Bhai monaga nneyo, bhashilambo bhakaalipanga koli. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Ikabheje tunaatumbayanje, nnjende kulitanda nkatambishe ndowana, shamaki shatandubhe tanjilajo muntole, munng'unukule kang'wa, nkatimo shimwiimane mmbiya ya koli. Ntole nkaapanganje pangunne na mmayene.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Ali Jwankulungwa Muupalume gwa Kunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maliko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Gene mobhago bhaajiganywa gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu, gubhabhushiyenje, “Gani ali jwankulungwa Muupalume gwa Kunnungu?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>A Yeshu gubhanshemile mwana jumo, gubhannjimishe pakati jabhonji, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>gubhashite, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, nkatendebhukanje nibha malinga bhana, ngu, nkajinjilanga Muupalume gwa Kunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Jojowe akwiinyegaya nibha malinga aju mwanaju, jwenejo shaabhe jwankulungwa Muupalume gwa Kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Jojowe akumposhela mwana jumo malinga jweneju kwa ligongo lyangu nne, anamboshela nne.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ilokoli ya Tenda Yambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maliko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>
    <figure style="fig" alt="Millstone" file="NT-01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:5">Bhandu Bhabhili Bhaliyaganga Ngano pa Liganga lya Yajiala</figure> Jojowe shannebhye jumo jwa bhashokonji bhaangulupalinga nne, mbaya akatabhilwe liganga likulungwa nnukoi nileshelwa pa shilindili sha mashi. <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Ole gwenunji bhandu bha pa shilambolyo kwa ligongo lya ilokoli. Ilokoli shiikoposhele, ikabheje ole gwakwe jwene shaikumbuyejo.<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Monaga nkono eu lukongono lwenu lunnebhyaga, nnukate na nnjae kwataliya. Mbaya nnjinjile mugumi gwa pitipiti nni gwangali nkono eu lukongono, nngalingana na leshelwa pa moto gwa pitipiti nni na makono na makongono genu ganaabhili. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Liyo lyenu linnebhyaga, nnikolotole na kulijaa kwataliya. Mbaya nnjinjile mugumi gwa pitipiti nni na shongo, nngalingana leshelwa pa moto gwa ku Jeanamu nni na meyo genu ganaabhili.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ngondolo Aobhile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Mwiteiganje! Nnannyegayanje jumo jwa bhashokonjibha. Ngunakummalanjilanga, ashimalaika bhabhonji kunnunguko mobha gowe pubhalinginji tome na Atati bha Kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Pabha Mwana juka Mundu ashinkwiya kwaatapulanga bhandu bhaobhilenje.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana ga bhukala gangali gwene nshitaligu.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>Nkubhonanga bhuli? Mundu akolaga ngondolo makumi kumi, anng'obhaga jumo, shatende bhuli? Anakwiileka ngondolo makumi tisha na tisha ila pa shitumbi, nikwenda kunnoleya aobhile jula. <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, ampataga apinga kwinonyela kupunda makumi tisha na tisha yangaobha ila. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Nneyo peyo, Ainabhenunji bha Kunnungu bhakaapinga aobhe nkali jumo jwa bhashokonjibha.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kunneya Alebhile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Mpwenu annebhelaga, munjendele nkanneye nninginji mmabhilipe. Ampilikanaga mumpatile mpwenu. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Akampilikane, nnjende naka mundu jumo eu bhabhili na mmayene, nkupinga kwa ukong'ondelo gwa bhandu bhabhili eu bhatatu, monaga lipali lilobhe limanyishe nimala. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Akaapilikanilanje bhanganyabho, mwaalugulilanje bhandu bha nnikanisha. Na monaga akaapilikanilanje, mumone malinga bhandu bhakakwaamanyanga a Nnungu eu bhakamula koli.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutabha na Gopola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, shoshowe shishintabhanje pa shilambolyo, shishitabhwe kunnungu, na shoshowe shishinngopolanje pa shilambolyo shishigopolwe kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 18:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga kabhili, bhabhili bhenunji pa shilambolyo bhalaganangaga shoshowe sha juga, Atati bhali kunnungu shibhaatendelanje. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Pabha popowe pubhaimananga bhandu bhabhlili eu bhatatu kwa ligongo lyangu nne, nne mbali pamo na bhanganyabho.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Ntumishi Akaaleshelela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Kungai a Petili gubhaajendele a Yeshu, gubhaabhushiye, “Bhuli Mmakulungwa, mpwanga anebhele palingwa ninneshelele? Nkali pa shabha?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Ngaalugula mala shabhape, ikabhe nkali makumi shabha mala shabha. <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>Pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu unalandana naka mpalume jumo atendile eshabhu ika ntumishi jwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Eshabhu ikatandubheje, gubhapeleshelwe mundu jumo alongwaga ligambo mmbiya yaigwinji. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Jwene mundujo akakweteje shindu sha lipa, bhakulungwa bhakwe gubhaamulishe aushwe jwenejo na akagwe na ashibhanagwe na indu yowe yaakwete, nkupinga lipila ligambo lila. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Bhai, ntumishi jula gwabhatindibhalile, nigwashite, ‘Nnindile shininnipe ligambo lyenu lyowe.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Bhakulungwa bhala gubhammonele shiya ntumishi jula, gubhanneshelele ligambo lila, gubhanneshile aijabhulile.<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Ntumishi jula gwajabhwile, gwanng'imene ntumishi nnjakwe annongaga ligambo lya mmbiya makumi kumi. Gubhankamwile, nikunkida pa nngulo alinkuti, ‘Unipe inguulonga!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Ntumishi nnjakwe jula akuntindibhalilaga nikunshondelesheya, alinkuti ‘Nninde shininnipe yowe’. <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Ikabheje jwanngakunda, gwapite kuntabha kuligelesha mpaka pushalipe ligambo lyowe.<verse eid="MAT 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>“Bhai, bhatumishi ajakwenji bhakaibhonanjeje itendeshe gubhainginikenje kwa kaje, nigubhapite kwatashiyanga bhakulungwa bhabhonji gakoposhele. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Bhakulungwa bhala gubhanshemile ntumishi jula, gubhammalanjlile, ‘Ugwe ujwanyata ntima! Gwashinkunyuga nikuleshelele, gunikuleshelele ligambo lyako lyowe. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Bhuli, ikapinjikweje ugwe kummonnela shiya ntumishi nnjako malinga shinikubhonele shiya nne?’<verse eid="MAT 18:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>“Bhai, bhakulungwa bhala gubhatumbele kaje, nigubhampeleshe akapotekwe mpaka pushalipe ligambo lyowe. <verse eid="MAT 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, Atati bhali kunnungu shibhantendelanje nneyo peyo monaga mundu akanneshelele mpwakwe mpaka muntima.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Ga Ngani ja Lekana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maliko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje kubheleketa gene malobhego, gubhajabhwile ku Galilaya nigubhapite ku Yudea, kung'ambu lushi lwa Yolodani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinji gubhaakagwilenje kweneko, gubhaalamiyenje bhalwelenji.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Mapalishayo bhananji gubhaaishilenje, gubhaalinjilenje bhalinkutinji, “Bhuli, alali mundu kunneka nkagwe kwa shiumilo shoshowe?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhuli, nkanabhe shomanga Majandiko ga Ukonjelo kuti a Nnungu kundandubho bhashikumpanganya mundu jwa shileu naka jwankongwe, <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>nigubhashite, ‘Kwa lyene ligongolyo, jwannume shabhaleshe ainagwe na akwabhe, nilundana na akagwe, na bhanaabhili shibhabhanganje shiilu shimo?’ <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Kwa nneyo, bhanganyabho nngabha bhabhili kabhili, ikabhe shiilu shimo. Bhai, shibhalundikenye a Nnungu, mundu analekanye.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Ikabheje Mapalishayo gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhai, kwa ndi a Musha bhashinkutulajila kunneka, nikunnjandishila talaka jwankongwe?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “A Musha bhashinkunnekanga ntendanje nneyo kwa ligongo lya nonopa mitima jenunji, ikabheje kundandubho ikaliji nneyo. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Bhai ngunakummalanjilanga, jojowe shanneshe nkagwe ikabhe kwa ligongo lya labhalabha, nilomba jwankongwe juna, analabhalabha na akunnomba jwankongwe aleshilwe jula analabhalabha.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana ga bhukala gangali gene malobhega “Akunnomba jwankongwe aleshilwe jula, analabhalabha.”</char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaalugulilenje, “Ibhaga indu ya mundu naka nkagwe ili nneyo, mbaya nngalomba.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nngabha bhowe shibhakundanje gene majiganyo gano, ikabhe bhajaliwenje na a Nnungu kutama gwangalomba bhala. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Pabha ipali iumilo ya tama gwangalomba, bhana shibhelekwa, bhana bhashiunwanga ntonga na bhandu, na bhana kwa ligongo lya tumishila Upalume gwa Kunnungu. Akombola kukunda gene majiganyo gano, akunde.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaajujilanga Mboka Bhana</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maliko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Kungai bhandu gubhaapeleshelenje a Yeshu bhana bhabhashoko nkupinga bhaabhishilanje makono nikwaajujilanga. Ikabheje bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaakalipilenje. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, “Mwaalekanje bhanabho bhajiyangane kwangu nne, wala nnaaibhililanje, pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu gwa bhandunji bhalinginji malinga bhanabha.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Bhai, gubhaabhishilenje makono nkwaajujilanga mboka, nigubhashoshile pepala.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nshanda Aliji Tajili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maliko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Mundu jumo ashinkwaishila a Yeshu, gwabhabhushiye, “Mmajiganya mmammbone, ndende shindu shashi sha mmbone nkupinga mbate gumi gwa pitipiti?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>A Yeshu gubhammalanjile, “Pakuti, unanjema najwammbone? A Nnungupe jikape nibhali bhammbone. Upingaga kujinjila mugumi gwa pitipiti, ukunde amuli ya a Nnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Mundu jula akwaabhuyaga, “Amuli yashi?” A Yeshu gubhashite, “Unabhulaje, Unalabhelabhe, Unajibhe, Unakong'ondele unami, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>Gwaajogope ainago na akwenu, na gumpinje ntami nnjako malinga shukwiipinga gwamwene.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Nshanda jula gwabhalugulile, “Gene gowego nigakamwile, shindubhile nndi kabhili?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>A Yeshu gubhannugulile, “Monaga upingaga kukamilika, kaushe indu yako, mmbiyayo ukaapanganje bhaalaga, na ugwe shukole shibhiko kunnungu, kungai ujiye kuungagule.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Nshanda jula akapilikaneje genego, gwaijabhulile ali ainjishe, pabha ashinkubha tajili.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga ipingabha ukomu tajili kujinjila Muupalume gwa Kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Ngunakummalanjilanga kabhili, ikakomala kuka nnyama jwankulungwa jwa langwa ashemwa ngamia, kupeleta pa lilanga lya ingano, nngalingana tajili kujinjila Muupalume gwa Kunnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 19:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Bhakapilikananjeje nneyo bhaajiganywa bhala gubhalapilenje kwa kaje, nigubhashitenje “Bhai gani, shakombole kutapulwa?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>A Yeshu gubhaalolilenje, nigubhashite, “Ku bhandu indu malinga yeneyo ikaakomboleka, ikabheje kwa mashili ga a Nnungu, yowe inakomboleka.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Kungai a Petili gubhashite, “Bhuli uwe? Tushileka yowe kunkagula mmwe, bhai shitupate nndi?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga kunnungu na shilambolyo pushiijiyebha ya ambi, Mwana juka Mundu shatame pa shitengu shakwe sha ukonjelo, numbe mmanganya likumi limo na bhabhili nngagwilenje nne, shintamangane mwiitengu likumi limo na ibhili nnikwaukumulanga makabhila likumi limo na gabhili ga Ishilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Na jojowe aleshile nyumba, eu ashaapwakwe eu ashaalumbugwe, eu ainagwe eu akwabhe, eu bhana eu migunda, kwa ligongo lyangu nne, shaposhele mala makumi kumi na shakole gumi gwa pitipiti. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Ikabheje bhabhagwinji bhalinginji bhantai, shibhabhanganje bha kumpelo, na bhalinginji bha kumpelo shibhabhanganje bhantai.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Bhakamula Maengo Munngunda gwa Shabhibhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Upalume gwa Kunnungu ushilandana naka mundu akwete nngunda gwa mishabhibhu, nilabha lyamba kukwaatolanga bhakamula maengo kubhakamulanje liengo mungunda gwakwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Gubhalegene nabhonji kwaalipanga ela jimo kwa lyubha limo, kungai gubhaapelekenje kunngunda gwabho. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Jikaisheje shaa tatu ja lyamba gubhapite kabhili kushoko gubhaabhweninji bhandunji bhana bhajimingenenje kushoko, bhangalinginji shatenda. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, ‘Nnjendangananje nkakamulanje liengo kunngunda gwangu gwa mishabhibhu, na nne shininnimpanganje aki jenunji.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Bhai, gubhapitengene. Bhayene nngunda bhala gubhapite kabhili shaa shita ja mui, na shaa tisha nndengulo, gubhatendile nneila peila. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Nkali shaa kumi na moja ja shigulogulo, gubhapite kabhili, gubhaaimenenje bhandunji bhana bhajimingenenje kushoko. Bhai, gubhaabhushiyenje, ‘Pakuti nshijimangana totolo gwangali kamula liengo?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Gubhaajangwilenje, ‘Pabha jwakwapi atupele liengo.’ Nabhalabho gubhaalugulilenje, ‘Nnjendanje nkakamulanje liengo mungunda gwa mishabhibhu.’<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Kukapilileje, bhayene nngunda bhala gubhannugulile nkujimilila jwabho, ‘Gwaashemanje bhaakamula maengo gwaalipanje nshaala gwabhonji, tandubhila jwa kumpelo, mpaka jwa ntai.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Bhai, gubhaikengene bha kumpelo bhala, gubhaposhelenje kila mundu ela jimo. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Bhakaikanganeje bhatainji bhala, pubhaganishiyenje shibhapegwanje kupunda bhananji bhala, ikabheje na bhalabhonji gubhapegwilwenje ela jimo jimo <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Gubhaposhelenje ela yabhonji, gubhatandwibhenje kwainginishila bhakulungwa bhala. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>Bhalinkutinji, ‘Abha bhandunji bhatolilwenje kumpelo bhashikamulanga liengo lishaa limope, pakuti nshikututendela malinga bhanganyabha, uwe tushikamula liengo kwa kaje nibhalilwa na lyubha totolo?’<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>“Bhakulungwa bhala gubhannjangwile jumo, ‘Ambwiga, shakwa shininkumbile! Bhuli, twangalagana nshaala gwa ela jimo kwa lyubha limo? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Nntole aki jenu, mwijabhulile. Njipinga kwaapanganga bha kumpelobha malinga mmwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Bhuli, ngapinjikwa tenda shingupinga namwene kwa indu yangu? Bhuli, nnamonela lupimilo pabha njibha nannguja?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>A Yeshu gubhamaliye bheleketa bhalinkuti, “Bhalinginji kumpelo shibhabhanganje bha ntai, na bha ntai, shibhabhanganje bha kumpelo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabheleketa gwa Tatu Gawa na Yuka Kwabho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maliko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>A Yeshu pubhajombokaga kwenda ku Yelushalemu, bhashinkwaatolanga bhaajiganywa likumi limo na bhabhili bhala kuntemela na bhalinginji mumpanda gubhaalugulilenje, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Mpilikananje! Tunakwenda ku Yelushalemu, na kweneko Mwana juka Mundu apinga kamuywa ku bhakulungwa bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha Shalia na bhalabhonji shibhanng'ukumulanje abhulagwe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Shibhankamuyanje kubhandu bhangabha Bhayaudi, nkupinga bhannyegayanje na akomwe ibhoko na komelwa munshalabha, ikabhe lyubha lya tatu shayuywe.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kujuga kwa Anyinamundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maliko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Penepo anyinabhabhonji bhana bha a Shebhedayo gubhaaishile a Yeshu bhali na ashibhana bhabho, gubhaatindibhalile nikwaajuga shindu.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhushiye, “Nkupinga nndi?” Bhakongwe bhala gubhaalugulile, “Nnumbile kuti ashibhanangubha shibhatamangananje Muupalume gwenu jumo nkono nshinda na juna nkono nnilo.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Nkakushimanyanga shinkujuganga. Bhuli, shinkombolanje kwiipililila malanga ga mboteko malinga shimbinga pitila nne?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Shitukombole.” <verse eid="MAT 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli shimwiipilililanje malanga ga mboteko gumbinga pitila nne, ikabheje gani shatame kunkono nnilo eu nkono nshinda gwangu, nngabha gangu nne, ikabhe shibhapegwanje bhapanjilwenje na a Nnungu bhala.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Bhaajiganywa likumi limo bhala bhakapilikananjeje genego, gubhaatumbalilenje ashaajabhonji bhabhili bhala. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>A Yeshu gubhaashemilenje, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmumanyinji kuti bhaatagwala bha bhandu bhangabha Bhayaudi bhanakwaatagwalanga bhandu kwa mashili, na bhakulungwanji bhabhonji bhanakwabhonelanga nneyo peyo. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Kwenu mmanganya inabhe nneyo, ikabhe mundu apinga kubha jwankulungwa, abhe ntumishi jwenunji, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>na mundu apinga kubha jwantai munkumbi gwenunji abhe ntumwa jwenunji. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Nneyo peyo, Mwana juka Mundu jwangaika kukamulilwa maengo, ikabheje kukamula liengo na shoya gumi gwakwe nkupinga kwaagombolanga bhandu bhabhagwinji.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwalamyanga Ashinangalole Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maliko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>A Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhalishokangana ku Yeliko, lugwinjili lwa bhandu gulwaakagwile. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Bhai, bhashinkupagwanga ashinangalole bhabhili bhatemingenenje nnyenje mpanda, bhakapilikananjeje kuti a Yeshu bhapinga pita gwene mpandago, gubhautienje lilobhe, “Mmakulungwa, Bhaulongo gwa a Daudi, nntubhonele shiya!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Lugwinjili lwa bhandu lula bhakwaakalipilangaga kupinga bhapumulanje. Ikabheje bhanganyabho gubhapundilenje kweya lilobhe, “Mmakulungwa, Bhaulongo gwa a Daudi, nntubhonele shiya!” <verse eid="MAT 20:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>A Yeshu gubhajimi, gubhaashemilenje nikwabhuyanga, “Nkupinganga nintendelanje nndi?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Gubhaajangwilenje, “Mmakulungwa, tunajuga tulole.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhonelenje shiya, gubhaakwashiyenje meyo gabhonji, na shangupe gubhalolilenje, nigubhaakagwilenje.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanajinjila ku Yelushalemu kwa Nng'angalo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maliko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yowana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>A Yeshu na bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakabhandishilanjeje ku Yelushalemu gubhaikengenenje ku Bhetipage tome na shitumbi sha Misheituni, gubhaatumilenjeje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhabhili, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>gubhaalugulilenje, “Nnjendangane kushijiji shili mmujo jenunji, kweneko shimung'imananje mbunda atabhilwe naka mwanagwe. Mwagopolanje nkajiye nabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Monaga mundu ammuyangaga shoshowe, munnugulilanje, ‘Bhakulungwa bhanakwaapinganga,’ nabhalabho shangupe shibhampanganje.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Genega gashinkutendeka nkupinga gatimilile gegala galugwilwe na ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhalinkuti,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Mwaabhalanjilanje bhashilambo ku Shayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">‘Munnole, Mpalume jwenu anakwiya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Ashikwitimalika na ashikwela mbunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Mwana jwa mbunda.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Bhaajiganywa bhala gubhapitengene, nigubhatendilenje malinga shibhalugulilwenje na a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Gubhanjiye nabhonji mbunda jula naka mwanagwe, gubhatandikenje nngubho yabhonji panani jabhonji na a Yeshu gubhakwelile nitama panani nngubho paka mwana mbunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Bhandu bhagumbelenje bhala gubhatandikenje nngubho yabhonji ina mumpanda, na bhandu bhananji gubhatemilenje maagala gubhatandikenje mumpanda. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Bhandu bhabhagwinji bhalinginji mmujo na bhalinginji nnyuma bhala, gubhautiyenje lilobhe bhalinkutinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Nnumbililwe Bhaulongo gwa a Daudi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Apegwe mboka jwene akwiya kwa lina lya Bhakulungwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Bhalumbililwe a Nnungu bhali Kunnungu!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>A Yeshu bhakajinjileje ku Yelushalemu, shilambo showe gushigumbele nnjasha. Bhandunji gubhalinginji nkubhuya, “Jweneju gani?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Likundi lya bhandunji munkumbi mula gubhashitenje, “Bhenebha a nkulondola bha a Nnungu a Yeshu, kopoka ku Nashaleti shilambo sha Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanabhinga Bhandu ku Liekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maliko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yowana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhajinjile ku liekalu, gubhaabhinjilenje palanga bhandu bhaushangaga na uma indu ku liekalu, gubhapindikulenye mesha ya bhaatindiganya mmbiya bhala na itengu ya bhaushanga ngunda. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Gubhaalugulilenje, “Ishijandikwa Mmajandiko ga Ukonjelo, ‘Nyumba jangu shijishemwe nyumba ja nyujila nne.’ Ikabheje mmanganya nshikujitendanga lishembo lya bhaapokonyola indu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Ashinangalole na bhalemelenje gubhaajendelenje ku liekaluko, nabhalabho a Yeshu gubhaalamiyenje. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Bhai, bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha Shalia bhakaibhonanjeje ilapo ibhatendile a Yeshu, na bhana bhashoko pubhautiyangaga lilobhe ku liekalu bhalinkutinji, “Bhalumbililwe Bhaulongo gwa a Daudi,” gubhatumbelenje. <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Kwa nneyo gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhuli, nkapilikana ibhaabheleketanga?” A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Elo, ngulipilikana! Bhuli, nkanabhe shomanga Mmajandiko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">‘Kwa kang'wa ya bhana bhashoko na ashinambombe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:16">Shibhannumbililanje.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Bhai, gubhaaleshilenje, gubhajabhwile pa shilambo pala gubhapite ku Bhetania, gubhagonile kweneko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nkongo Ukaogoya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maliko 11:12-14</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Lyambape a Yeshu bhalibhuja kwenda ku Yelushalemu, gubhakwete shibhanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Gubhagubhweni nkongo gumo gwa tini nnyenje mpanda, gubhaujendele, ikabheje bhangashibhona shindu ikabhe maambape. Bhai, gubhaulugulile nkongo gula, “Unaogoye kabhili iepo pitipiti!” Shangupe nkongo gwa tini gula ukunyalaga.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Bhaajiganywa bhakaubhonanjeje bhashinkulapanga, gubhashitenje, “Kwa nndi agu nkongogu ushinyala shangupe?” <verse eid="MAT 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, monaga nkolangaga ngulupai gwangali lipamba, shinkombolanje tenda nngabha ga ntinipe, ikabheje nkali kushilugulila ashi shitumbishi, ‘Tutumbuka ukatumbushile mmashi,’ shiitendeshe. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Na nkolangaga ngulupai, shoshowe shishinnjuganje kwa a Nnungu, shimpegwanje.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Ukulungwa gwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maliko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>A Yeshu bhakajinjileje ku liekalu bhali nkujiganya, bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhanangulungwa bha bhandunji gubhaajendelenje nikwaabhuya, “Nnatenda genega kwa ukulungwa ukeni? Gani ampele jene amuliji?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Na nne ngunakumuyanga, nnyangulangaga, bhai na nne shininnugulilanje ngunatenda genega kwa ukulungwa ukeni. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Bhuli, ubhatisho gwa a Yowana kugwakoposhele kwei? Bhuli, kugwakoposhele kwa a Nnungu eu ku bhandu?” Ikabheje gubhabheketelenje ashaayenenji, Tulugulaga, “Kugwakoposhele kwa a Nnungu,” shibhatubhuye, “Bhai, pakuti mwangakulupalilanga?”<verse eid="MAT 21:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Na tulugulaga, “Kugwakoposhele ku bhandu,” tunakwaajogopanga bhandunji pabha bhowe bhanakundanga kuti a Yowana ankulondola bha a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Bhai, gubhaajangwilenje, “Tukakumumanya!” Nabhalabho a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Numbe nne ngannugulilanga ngunatenda genega kwa ukulungwa gwashi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Bhana Bhabhili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Mmanganya nkubhonanga bhuli? Bhandu bhamo bhashinkukola bhana bhabhili. Gubhannugulile jwankulu jula, ‘Mwanangu, lelo ukakamule liengo kunngunda gwa mishabhibhu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Nshanda jula gwajangwile, ‘Ngajenda!’ Ikabheje gwaibhushiye, kungai gwapite kamula liengo. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Ainamundu bhala gubhannugulile jwa nnung'una jula nneila peila, jwalakwe akwaajangulaga, ‘Atati shinyende!’ Ikabheje jwangajenda. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Bhuli, bhene bhabhilibha jwei atendile ibhapinga Ainamundu?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Jwankulu jula.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, bhakamula koli na bha labhalabha shibhannongolelanje kujinjila Muupalume gwa a Nnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Pabha a Yowana bhanng'ishilenje na kunnanguyanga mpanda gwa aki mwangaakulupalilanga, ikabheje bhakamula koli na bha labhalabha bhashinkwaakulupalilanga. Nkali nkagabhonanjeje gowego mmanganya mwangaipetanga nikwaakulupalila.<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Nngunda gwa Mishabhibhu na Bhaalimanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maliko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>A Yeshu gubhashite, mpilikananje lutango luna. Bhandu bhamo bhashinkulima nngunda gwa mishabhibhu, gubhatimbiliye lubhigo, gubhaolile liiko lya minyila divai, gubhashenjile na nyingo ja tama bhalinda. Kungai gubhaakolishiyenje bhaalima, gubhajabhwile kwenda shilambo sha talika. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Gakaisheje mobha ga maneng'eno, gubhaatumilenje bhatumishi bhabho ku bhaalimanga bhala, nkupinga bhakatolelanje ndalo.<verse eid="MAT 21:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Bhaalimanga bhala gubhaakamwilenje bhatumishi bhala, jumo gubhankomilenje na juna gubhammulegenje na juna gubhankomilenje maganga mpaka gwawile. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Bhandu bhala gubhaatumilenje kabhili bhatumishi bhana, bhabhagwinji punda bhalongolelenje bhala. Bhaalimanga bhala gubhaatendelenje nneila peila malinga bhalongolelenje bhala. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Kumpelo gubhantumile mwanagwabho akuno bhaliganishiya, shibhannjogopanje pabha mwanangu. <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Ikabheje bhaalimanga bhala bhakammonanjeje mwanagwabho gubhabheleketenje ashaayenenji, “Jweneju ni apinga lishi, tummulaje tutole ulishi gwakwe!” <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Bhai, gubhankamwilenje, gubhampelekenje kunyenje nngunda gwa mishabhibhu gula, gubhammulegenje.<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>“Lelo, bhayene nngunda gwa mishabhibhu pushibhaishepo, shibhaatendanje bhuli bhaalimangabho?” <verse eid="MAT 21:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Gubhajangwilenje, “Shibhaabhulaganje bhaalimanga bhangali bha mbonenjibho, na nngunda gula shibhaapanganje bhaalimanga bhananji, shibhajiye kwaapanganga ndalo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Penepo a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhuli, nkanabheshomanga yenei Mmajandiko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Liganga libhalikanilenje bhaashenga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Nnaino lishibha liganga likulu lya pa ndumba.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Bhakulungwa bhatendile lyeneli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Na kunngwetu uwe ni lya lapa!’<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>“Kwa nneyo ngunakummalanjilanga, Upalume gwa a Nnungu upinga shoywa kungwenunji, bhapegwanje bhandunji bha ilambo ina, shibhakombolanje kutenda ibhapinga a Nnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Na jwene shaagwile lyene ligangalyo, shatemekanje ipande, na jojowe shilinngwile lyene ligangalyo, shakandaganywe.<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na Mapalishayo bhakapilikananjeje ndango ya a Yeshu, gubhamumanyinji kuti bhanakwaabheleketanga. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Kwa nneyo gubhaloleyenje mwakwaakamulila, ikabheje bhatendaga kwaajogopanga bhandunji, pabha bhandunji bhamumanyinji kuti ankulondola bha a Nnungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Kalamu ja Ndowa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>A Yeshu gubhabhelekete nabhonji kabhili kwa lutango bhalinkuti, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Upalume gwa kunnungu ushilandana naka mpalume jumo antendele mwanagwe kalamu ja ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Bhai, gubhatumile bhatumishi bhabho bhajendangane kukwaatolanga bhashemilwenje ku ndowa, ikabheje bhashemilwenje bhala bhashinkukananga. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Gubhatumile kabhili bhatumishi bhana, bhalinkuti, ‘Mwaalugulilanje bhashemilwenje bhala, kalamu jangu nnaino tayali, malume gangu ga ng'ombe ya jimbala na matumbwe iinjilwe na kila shindu tayali, nnjiyangane ku ndowa.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Ikabheje bhangaimukanga, gubhaijabhulilenje, juna ku nngunda gwakwe na juna ku indu yakwe nnyene, <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>bhananji gubhaakamwilenje bhatumishi bhala nikwatukananga, gubhaabhulegenje. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>A mpalume bhala gubhatumbele, gubhatumile manjola kukwaabhulaganga bhaabhulegenje bhatumishi bhabho, na joka moto shilambo shabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Kungai gubhaalugulilenje bhatumishi bhabho, ‘Kweli, kalamu ja ndowa pujili tayali, ikabheje bhashemilwenje bhala bhangapinjikwanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Bhai, nnjendangane mmalekano na bhobhowe bhushimwaimananje mwaashemanje bhaikangane ku ndowa.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Bhatumishi bhala gubhashoshilenje, gubhapitengene mmipanda, gubhaishe nabhonji bhandu bhowe, bha mmbonenji na bhangalinginji bha mmbonenji. Nyumba jila gujigumbele bhajeninji.<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Ikabheje a mpalume bhakajinjileje kukwaalolanga bhajeninji, gubhammweni mundu jumo jwangawala nngubho ja ndowa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Bhakulungwa gubhammushiye, ‘Ambwiga, nnjinjile bhuli gwangali wala nngubho ja ndowa?’ Ikabheje jwangajangula, gwaitamile ilili. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Penepo a mpalume bhala gubhaalugulilenje bhatumishi, ‘Muntabhanje makono na makongono nkanjaanje palanga ku lubhindu, kweneko shikubhe shililo na yaga meno.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 22:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>A Yeshu gubhamalishiye bhalinkuti, “Bhashemilwenje bhabhagwinji, ikabheje bhaagwilwenje bhashokope.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Lipa Koli kwa a Kaishali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maliko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Kungai, Mapalishayo gubhajabhulengene, nigubhapengenenje shanabhuli pushibhaatanjiyanje a Yeshu kwa malobhe gabho. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Bhai, gubhaatumilenje bhaajiganywa bhabhonji na bhandunji bha a Elode, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Mmaajiganya, tumumanyi kuti mmwe mmandu bha kulupalika, na nnaajiganya mpanda gwa a Nnungu kwa kulupalika na nkakunnjogopa mundu jojowe, pabha mmwe mwangali luagu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Bhai, ntulugulile nkubhona bhuli? Alali eu nngabha alali kulipa koli kwa a Kaishali?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu gubhaumanyi ungamanyika gwabhonji, gubhaalugulilenje, “Mmanganya mmagulumba, kwa nndi nnaninganga? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Nnanguyanje mmbiya ja lipila koli.” Gubhaalangwiyenje. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, “Pishaji na majandikoga gakeni?” <verse eid="MAT 22:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Gubhaajangwilenje, “Ya a Kaishali.” Penepo a Yeshu gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhai, ya a Kaishali mwaapanganje a Kaishali, na ya a Nnungu mwaapanganje a Nnungu.” <verse eid="MAT 22:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Bhakapilikananjeje nneyo gubhalapilenje, gubhajabhulengenenje nikwaaleka.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Yuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maliko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Lyene lyubhalyo, Mashadukayo bhananji bhaabheleketanga kuti, bhawilenje bhakayukanga, gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Bhai, gubhaabhushiyenje bhalinkutinji, “Mmajiganya, a Musha bhalugwile, mundu alombile awaga gwangali leka bhana, inapinjikwa jwannung'una abhatole bhakongwebho, nkupinga abhakolele bhana akulugwe. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Bhai, panngwetu pano bhashinkupagwanga bhandu shabha. Jwankulu ashinkulomba gwawile gwangali kolela bhana, gwanneshele mpwakwe bhashitenga bhala. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Nibha nneyo peyo kuka mpwakwe jwa bhili, naka jwa tatu, mpaka bhowe shabha. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Bhakawanganjeje bhowebho, bhakongwe bhala nabhalabho gubhawile. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Bhuli, lyubha lishibhayukanje, shibhabhe bhakongwe bhakeni? Pabha bhashinkulombwa na bhowe shabha.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Mmanganya nnapuganikanga kwa ligongo lya nngagamanya Majandiko ga Ukonjelo wala mashili ga a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Pabha bhawilenje pushibhayukanje bhakalombanga wala lombwa, shibhabhanganje mbuti ashimalaika kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Ikabheje ga yuka bhawilenje, bhuli, nkanabhe shomanga gubhannugulilenje a Nnungu gala? Bhalinkuti, <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Nne a Nnungu bha a Bhulaimu na bha a Ishaka na bha a Yakobho!’ Bhai, bhenebho nngabha a Nnungu bha bhandu bhawilenje, ikabheje bha bhandu bhakotonji.” <verse eid="MAT 22:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Bhandu bhagumbelenje bhala bhakapilikananjeje nneyo, gubhalapilenje kwa majiganyo gabho.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli Jikulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maliko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Mapalishayo bhakapilikananjeje kuti a Yeshu bhashikwaapeyanga Mashadukayo, gubhaimenenje pamo. <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>Jumo munkumbi gwabhonji, akujimanya Shalia, akwaabhuyaga a Yeshu nkwaalinga, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Mmaajiganya, amuli jashi jili jikulungwa Nshalia ja a Musha?” <verse eid="MAT 22:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “ ‘Mwaapinje Bhakulungwa a Nnungu bhenu kwa ntima gwenu gowe na mbumu yenu yowe na kwa lunda lwenu lowe’. <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Jeneji ni amuli jikulungwa na ja ntai. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Jabhili jilandana na jenejo, ‘Mwaapinje atami ajenu malinga shinkwipinga mmayene’. <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Shalia yowe ya a Musha na majiganyo ga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu inashimilika kwa yene amulii.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga a Kilishitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maliko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Mapalishayo bhakaimananjeje pamo, a Yeshu gubhaabhushiyenje, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Mmanganya nkubhonaga bhuli ga a Kilishitu? Bhuli, mwana juka gani?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Bhaulongo gwa a Daudi.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Bhai, ikomboleka bhuli kwa a Daudi kwa longoywa naka Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo bhanakwaashema a Kilishitu Bhakulungwa? Pabha bhashinkubheleketa,<verse eid="MAT 22:43"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‘Bhakulungwa bhashinkwaalugulila Bhakulungwa bhangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">“Ntame nkono nnilo gwangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Mpaka pushinaabhikanje ashaamagongo ajenu pa makongono genu.” ’<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Bhai, ibhaga a Daudi bhanakwaashema a Kilishitu ‘Bhakulungwa’ nibha bhuli bha ulongo bhabho?” <verse eid="MAT 22:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Wala jwakwa mundu abhajangwile. Tandubhila penepo jwakwa mundu alinjile kwaabhuya kabhili.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaakananga Bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maliko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43-46">Luka 11:43-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje bhandunji bhagumbelenje na bhaajiganywa bhabho, bhalinkuti. <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>Bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo bhashipegwanga ukulungwa gwa shitengu sha a Musha. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Kwa nneyo nkamulanje na tenda shoshowe shishibhannugulilanje. Ikabheje nnakaguyanje itendi yabhonji, pabha bhakaatendanga malinga shibhaajiganyanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Bhanatabhanga mishigo ja topa nikwaatwikanga bhandunji mmakoyo, ikabheje ashaayenenji bhakapinganga kujangutila nkali kwa lukowe.<verse eid="MAT 23:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Bhanatendanga itendi yabhonji nkupinga bhalolwanje na bhandunji. Bhanawalanga mabhadili gamakulungwa pa shenyi na mmakono gajandikwe Shalia na leupya mbundo ya pai ya nngubho yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Bhanaapinganga tama mwiitengu ya mmujo nkalamu na mmashinagogi. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Bhanapinganga kukomaywa kwa jogopekwa kushoko na bhanapinganga shemwa na bhandunji, Bhaajiganya. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Ikabheje mmanganyanji nnashemwanje, Bhaajiganya, pabha bhaajiganya bhenunji bhamope, na mmanganya mmowe malinga bhandu bha lutumbo lumo. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Wala nnanshemanje mundu jojowe, Atati, pa shilambolyo, pabha Ainabhenunji bhamope, bhali kunnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Wala nnashemwanje, Ashikalongolele, pabha kalongolele jwenunji jumope, ni a Kilishitu. <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Ali jwankulungwa munkumbi gwenunji anapinjikwa abhe ntumishi jwenunji. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Jojowe akwiikuya apinga nyegaywa, na akwiinyegaya apinga kuywa.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanagamba Ugulumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maliko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>Ole gwenunji bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo, mmagulumba! Pabha nnakwaugalilanga bhandunji nnango gwa Upalume gwa Kunnungu, mwaashayenenji nkajinjilanga, na wala bhapinganga jinjila bhala nkakwaalekanga bhajinjilangane. <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Ole gwenunji mmaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo bhagulumba! Pabha nnapokonyolanga nyumba ya bhashitenga na nnajuganga Nnungu kwa leupya, nkupinga mmonekananje kubhandu kuti mmambonenji, kwa nneyo shinng'ukumulwanje kupunda bhananji.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana ga bhukala gangali gwene nshitaligu.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>Ole gwenunji bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo, mmagulumba! Nnaowanga mmashi na pa litaka nkupinga mumpatanje mundu shakagule dini jenunji. Mumpatangaga, nnakuntendanga mwana jwa ku Jeanamu pabhili kupunda mwaashayenenji.<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>Ole gwenunji ashikalongolele nangalole! Mmanganya nkutinji mundu alumbilaga kwa lina lya liekalu, kwene kulumbilako nngabha shindu, ikabheje alumbilaga kwa shaabhu ili nniekalu, kwene lumbilako kunakuntabha. <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Mmanganya ashikalongolele bhangumba! Shei shipundile, shaabhu eu liekalu litenda jene shaabhujo jibhe ja ukonjelo? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Kabhili nnkutinji kuti mundu alumbilaga kwa shitala nngabha shindu, ikabheje alumbilaga kwa mbepei ibhishilwe pa shitala, kwene lumbilako kunakuntabha. <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Mmanganya ashinangalole! Shei shipundile, upo ila, eu shitala shitenda mbepeiyo ibhe ya ukonjelo? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Alumbila kwa shitala analumbila kwa shitala, na kwa indu yowe ili pa shitala. <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>Na alumbila ku liekalu ashilumbila ku liekalu na kwa bhatama nkati bhala. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Na alumbila kunnungu ashilumbila ku shitengu sha Upalume gwa a Nnungu, na bhaatama panani jakwe.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>Ole gwenunji bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo, mmagulumba! Nnashoyanga lipungu lya kumi, nkali maamba ga mmboga, bhishali na tindi, akuno nnilekanga indu ya mana ya Shalia malinga, aki na shiya na ngulupai. Genega gumpinjilwenje kugabhika mmitima gwangali kulibhala gana. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Ashikalongolele nangalole! Nnashoyanga libhembe, ikabheje nimila ngamia, nnyama jwankulungwa.<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Ole gwenunji bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo, mmagulumba! Mmanganya nninginji malinga mundu aukanga ikombe na bhakuli kua, ikabheje nkati mugumbele indu impatilenje kwa pokonyola na shojo. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Mmwe a Palishayo nangalole! Nng'ukanje oti shikombe nkati na kua shikukonje.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Ole gwenunji bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo, mmagulumba! Puninginji mbuti likabhuli lipashilwe shokaa, kwa palanga linabhoneka kukonja, ikabheje nkati kushigumbala maupa ga bhawilenje na ikoko yaigwinji. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Nneyo peyo mmanganya nnabhonekanga na bhandunji mbuti nkwetenje aki, ikabheje nkati nshigumbalanga ugulumba na ungamanyika.<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumu Jinakwiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Ole gwenunji bhaajiganya bha Shalia na Mapalishayo, mmagulumba! Nnashenjelanga makabhuli ga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu na konjeleya makabhuli ga bhandunji bhakwetenje aki. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Nnikutinji, ‘Monaga uwe tukapali bhukala ja ashinakulu bhetu, tukanakunde kwaabhulaganga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu!’ <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Kwa nneyo, nnakong'ondelanga mwaashayenenji kuti mmanganya bha ulongo gwa bhaabhulegenje ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Bhai, mmaliyanje liengo libhatandubhenje bhanyikala bhenunji lila. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Mmanganya nninginji malinga majoka, bhana bha majoka! Shinnjikubhutukanje bhuli ukumu ja ku Jeanamu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Pabha nnolanje, nne ngunakumpeleshelanga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu, bhandunji bhakwetenje lunda na bhaajiganya bha Shalia. Bhananji nkupinga kwaabhulaganga na kwaakomelanga munshalabha bhananji, shimwaakomanje ibhoko mmashinagogi genunji na kwaabhinganga shilambo kwa shilambo. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Kwa nneyo kugambwa kowe shikung'ishilanje kwa ligongo lya minyai ja bhandunji bhakwetenje aki jijitishile pa litaka. Elo, tandubhila kubhulagwa kwa a Abheli bhaaliji bhanguja, mpaka kubhulagwa kwa a Shakalia bhanabhabho a Bhalakiya, bhumwaabhulegenje ku liekalu pakati shitala na liekalu. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, lwene lubhelekolu lupinga ukumulwa kwa ligongo lya genego.<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu na Shilambo sha Yelushalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Ugwe Yelushalemu, Ugwe Yelushalemu! Ukwaabhulaganga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu, na kwaakomanga maganga mpaka kuwa bhatumilwenje kunngwako bhala. Palingwa njilinga kwaakundikanyanga ashibhanago, malinga nanunu jwa nnguku shakuti kwiigutamila yana yakwe, ikabheje gwaangapinga. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Bhai nnoje, nyumba jako shijibhe liame na ushubha. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Pabha, nkamonanga kabhili mpaka pushimmeleketanje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 23:39">‘Apegwe mboka jwene akwiya kwa lina lya Bhakulungwa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanatalashiya ga Bhomolwa kwa Liekalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maliko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>A Yeshu gubhakopweshe ku liekalu nigubhaijabhulile, bhaajiganya bhabho gubhaajendelenje nikwaalanguya majumba gatimbilile liekalu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnikugabhonanga gene gowega! Kweli ngunakunnugulilanga, lyakwapi liganga nkali limo shililepeshe panani liganga, yowe ipinga bhomolwa.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ga Laga na Mboteko</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maliko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-9">Luka 21:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>A Yeshu bhakatameje pa shitumbi sha Misheituni, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje shintemela, gubhaabhushiyenje, “Nntulugulile genega pushigakoposhele shakani? Shilangulo shashi shishilanguye kwiya kwenu na mpelo gwa shilambolyo?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Mwiteiganje mundu anantembanje. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Pabha bhandu bhabhagwinji shibhaikangane bhalinkutinji, ‘Nne a Kilishitu,’ na bhalabhonji shibhaatembanje bhandu bhabhagwinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Shimpilikananje ililo ya ngondo na ngani ya ngondo, ikabheje nnajogopanje, pabha genego ganapinjikwa gakoposhele, ikabheje mpelo ukanabhe. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Shilambo shipinga komana na shilambo shina, upalume gumo upinga komana na upalume guna. Shipinga pagwa shibhanga na ungumila kwa ilambo. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Yene yoweyo mbuti kutandubha kwa mboteko ya shitumbo nkupinga kwiigopola.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Kungai bhandu bhowe shibhantendebhukanje nkupinga mpotekwanje na bhulagwa. Na bhandunji bhangabha Bhayaudi bhapinga kunshimanga kwa ligongo lyangu nne. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Kabhili, bhabhagwinji bhapinga lekanga ngulupai jabhonji na tendebhukana na shimana. <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>Bhapinga koposhelanga ashinkulondola bha unami bhabhagwinji bhapinga kwaapuganyanga bhandu bhabhagwinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Kwa ligongo lya jenjesheka ilebho, kupingana kwa bhandu shukubhujile nnyuma. <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>Ikabheje shaikakatimilile mpaka kumpelo shatapulwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Ngani ja Mmbone ja Upalume gwa a Nnungu jipinga lunguywa pa shilambolyo, kubha ukong'ondelo ku bhandu bhowe, penepo ni pushuishe mpelo gula.”<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shilaje sha Punda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maliko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>Ashomajo agamanye malombolelo ga malobhe ga a Yeshu gakwiya gano. Nigubhashite, a Danieli ankulondola bha a Nnungu bhalugwile ga nnjimwa ja nyatiya. Pushinnjibhonanje jijimi pa ukonjelo, <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>bhalinginji ku Yudea bhabhutushilanje mwiitumbi. <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Ali pashitubhili anatulushe pai kutola indu nnyumba jakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Ali kunngunda anabhuje kumui kutola nngubho yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Ole gwabhonji bhanabhakongwe bhakwetenje ndumbo na bhajonjeyanga gene mobhago. <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Nnjuganje kwa a Nnungu nkupinga kubhutuka kwenunji kunabhe mobha ga mmbepo eu Lyubha lya Pumulila. <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Pabha gene mobhago shipinga pagwa shilaje shikanabhe koposhela shitandubhile kupanganywa shilambolyo mpaka lelo, wala shikajiya pagwa kabhili. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Monaga gene mobhago a Nnungu bhakanapunguye jakwa mundu jojowe akatapwilwe, ikabheje gapinga punguywa kwa ligongo lya bhandu bhaagwilwenje na a Nnungu.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>Bhai, mundu annugulilangaga, a Kilishitu pubhali apano, eu kubhali akula, nnankulupalilanje. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Pabha bhaapinga koposhelanga Bhakilishitu na ashinkulondola bha unami. Bhapinga tendanga ilangulo ya ikulungwa na ya lapa ya kombola nkali kwapuganyanga bhaagwilwenje na a Nnungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Mpilikananje, njikunnimbiyanga gakanabhe koposhela genego.<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>Bhai, bhannugulilangaga, nnolanje, kubhali kuanga, nnajendangane kweneko, eu, nnolanje, mubhali nnyumba, nnakulupalilanje. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Pabha malinga nnjai shijikuti meta nibhoneka kuliunde kowe, pushiijiyebha malinga pushabhoneshe Mwana juka Mundu lyubha lyashaishe.<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>Malinga, pene puguli ntui, nipugaimana matumbui, kwa nneyo shene shilanguloshi shinalangula kuti ku mpelo gwa shilambolyo kubhandishile.<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiya kwa Mwana juka Mundu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maliko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>Shangupe shipitaga shilaje sha gene mobhago, lyubha lipingabha nnubhindu, mwei ukalangaya na ndondwa ipingagwa pai na mashili ga indu ya kunnungu gapinga tenganyika. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Kungai, shilangulo shika Mwana juka Mundu shishibhoneshe kunnungu, penepo makabhila gowe ga pa shilambolyo gapinga kwiigutanjila, shibhammonanje Mwana juka Mundu alikwiiya mmaunde ga kunnungu ali na mashili na ukonjelo gwanngwinji. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Na bhalabho shibhaatumanje ashimalaika bhabho na lipenga lya oneya, bhalabhonji bhapinga kwaalopolanga bhaagwilwenje bhabho kopoka mmbali yowe ya pa shilambolyo.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Majiganyo ga Nkongo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maliko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>Bhai kwa nkongo mwiijiganyanye alu lutangolu, shangupe nyambi yakwe puitandubha ipuka, nnakumumanyanga kuti shuku shibhandishile. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Nneyo peyo mmanganya pushinngabhonanje genega, mmumanyanje kuti bhabhandishile. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, alu lubhelekolu lukapela gakanabhe koposhela gowego. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Kunnungu na shilambolyo shiipite, ikabheje malobhe gangu gakapita.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Jwakwa Akulimanya Lyubha wala Malanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maliko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-36">Luka 17:26-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>Ikabheje, ga lyene lyubhalyo, eu malanga jwakwa mundu akugamanya shigabhe shakani, wala ashimalaika bha kunnungu, wala Mwana, ikabhe Atati jikape. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Pabha malinga shiyaliji mobha ga a Nuu, puipingabha mobha ga kwiya kwakwe Mwana juka Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Pabha gene mobhago, nduluko jikanabhe tuluka, bhandunji bhatenda lyanganga na kolelwa na lomba na lombwa, mpaka a Nuu pubhajinjile nshapina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Bhangashimanyanga shipinga koposhela, mpaka pujaishe nduluko, jikwaajolangaga bhowe. Na malinga pushiijiyebha lyubha lya kwiya kwakwe Mwana juka Mundu. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Gene mobhago bhandunji bhabhili shibhabhanganje mungunda, jumo shatolwe na juna shaleshwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Bhanabhakongwe bhabhili shibhabhanganje bhaliyaganga, jumo shatolwe na juna shaleshwe.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>Bhai, nsheyanje, pabha nkakulimanyanga lyubha lishibhaishe Bhakulungwa bhenunji. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Ikabheje nnimanyanje lyeneli, monaga bhayene nyumba bhakalimanyi lyubha lya kwiya nngwii, bhakasheshiye, ngubhakajileshileje nyumba jabho kujibhwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Kwa nneyo na mmanganya nsheyanje, pabha Mwana juka Mundu shaishe malanga gunkakugamanyanga.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumishi Akulupalika na Ntumishi Akaakulupalika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>A Yeshu gubhapundile kubheleketa bhalinkuti, bhai gani ntumishi akulupalika na akwete lunda, bhakulungwa bhakwe shibhantende abhe jwa nkulungwa ku bhandu bhabho, abhapanganje shalya pa malanga gakwe? <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Mbaya jwene ntumishi, bhakulungwa bhakwe pushibhaishe shibhanng'imane alitenda nneyo. <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, shibhammishe jwene ntumishijo agoye indu yabho yowe. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Ikabheje ntumishi jwangali jwa mmbone aibheleketelaga muntima gwakwe kuti, bhakulungwa bhangu bhanakabha kubhuja, <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>kungai gwatandwibhe kwaakomanga bhatumishi ajakwe na tandubha lya na papila pamo na bhaakolelwanga, <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>bhakulungwa bhakwe ntumishijo shibhaishe lyubha lyangaganishiwa na malanga gangamanyika. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Shibhankome kwa kaje na kunkundikanya likundi limo na bhagulumba. Kweneko shikubhe shililo na tauna meno.<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Bhali Likumi Limo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>Gene mobhago, Upalume gwa Kunnungu upinga landana na bhali likumi limo bhajigelenje taa yabhonji, gubhapitengene kukumposhela nkulomba. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Nng'ano munkumbi gwabhonji pubhalinginji bhangumba na nng'ano bhashinkukolanga lunda. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Bhangumba bhala bhaashinkujigalanga taa yabhonji gwangali mauta ga sheituni ga jenjesheya. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Ikabheje bhakwetenje lunda bhala bhashinkujigalanga mauta nnyupa na taa yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Pabha nkulomba ashinkukabha kwiya, bhali bhowe bhala gubhatandwibhenje kugweela na gubhagonilenje.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>Ikabheje pakati shilo guipilikanishe njobhela ya kuti, nkulomba anakwiya, nnjendangane nkaposhelanje. <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Penepo bhali bhowe bhala gubhajumukenje, gubhakolokweyenje taa yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Bhangumba bhala gubhaabhalanjilenje bhakwetenje lunda bhala kuti, ntupanganje mauta gashoko pabha taa yetu inaimika. <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Ikabheje bhakwetenje lunda bhala gubhashitenje, gakatujenela tubhowe! Mbaya nnjendangane nkaumanje kugaushwa! <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Bhai, bhali bhangumba bhala bhakajabhulanjeje kuuma mauta, nkulomba gwaishe, na bhali bhalinginji tayali bhala gubhajinjilenje nnyumba pamo nakankulomba, na nnango ukuugalwaga.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Kungai bhali bhananji bhala gubhaikengene nishema, ‘Mmakulungwa, mmakulungwa, ntuugulile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Ikabheje bhenebho gubhaajangwilenje, ‘Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, ngakummanyanga mmanganyanji.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhashite, “Bhai, nsheyanje, pabha nkakulimanyanga lyubha wala malanga.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lutango lwa Bhatumishi Bhatatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Pabha Upalume gwa Kunnungu ushilandana naka mundu apinjile jabhula mwanja, akwaashemangaga bhatumishi bhakwe nikwaakamuyanga indu yakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Gubhampele kila mundu malinga shibhammweni kombola kwakwe, jumo mmbiya nng'ano na juna mmbiya ibhili na juna mmbiya jimo, kungai gubhajabhwile. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Shangupe a apegwile mmbiya ng'ano jula gwatendile upindi, gwapatile mmbiya ina nng'ano. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Nneyo peyo na jwene apegwile mmbiya ibhili gwapatile mmbiya ina ibhili. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Ikabheje apegwile mmbiya jimo jula gwapite olela pai mmbiya ja bhakulungwa bhakwe jila.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Gakapiteje mobha gamagwinji, bhakulungwa bha bhatumishi bhala gubhabhujile, gubhatandwibhe pita bhalanganya mmbiya ibhakamwiye na ibhapatilenje muupindi. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Ntumishi apegwilwe mmbiya nng'ano gwaishe ali ajigele mmbiya nng'ano ina, akwaalugulilaga, ‘Mmakulungwa, mwashinkumba mmbiya nng'ano, nnole mmbiya nng'ano ina imbatile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Bhakulungwa bhakwe gubhannugulile, ‘Sha mmbone, ntumishi nnguja na jwaakulupalika. Ushikulupalika kwa indu ya ishoko, shinikupe gamakulungwa. Jiya uangalale pamo na nne.’<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>“Ntumishi juna apegwilwe mmbiya ibhili gwaishe, gwashoshiye mmbiya ibhili ina yapatile gwashite, ‘Mmakulungwa, mwashinkumba mmbiya ibhili bhai ntole na mmbiya ina ibhili imbatile.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Bhakulungwa bhakwe gubhannugulile, ‘Sha mmbone, ntumishi nnguja na jwaakulupalika. Ushikulupalika kwa indu ya ishoko, shinikupe ya ikulungwa. Jiya uangale pamo na nne.’<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>“Kungai gwaishe apegwilwe mmbiya jimo jula, gwashite, ‘Mmakulungwa, nimmanyi mmwe mmanonopa ntima, nnauna munkapandileje na kulopola munkamishiyeje mmbeju. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Nashinkujogopa, gung'ishiye mmbiya jenu pai. Bhai, nntole mmbiya jenu.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>“Bhakulungwa bhakwe gubhannugulile, ‘Ugwe ntumishi jwangali jwa mmbone na nkata! Gwamumanyi kuti ngunauna mungapandileje na ngunalopola mungamishiyeje. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Bhai, gwashinkupinjikwa kujibhika mmbiya jangu kubhenki na nne pushimujepo ngatolile mmbiya jangu na pwaida! <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Bhai, mumpokonyolanje mbiyajo nkampanganje akwete mmbiya likumi limo jula. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Pabha, akwete shindu apinga pegwa na jenjeshewa. Ikabheje jwangali shindu jula, nkali shakwete shila shapokonyolwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Na gaka ntumishi jwangali pwaida jula, munnjaanje palanga kulubhindu! Kweneko kupingabha shililo na tauna meno.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ukumu ja Kumpelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>Pushaishe Mwana juka Mundu mu ukonjelo gwakwe na ashimalaika bhakwe, penepo shatame pa shitengu shakwe sha upalume. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Bhandu bha ilambo yowe shibhaimananje mmujo jabho na bhalabho bhapinga agulanya bhandu mbuti nshunga shakuti agulanya ngondolo na mmbui. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Shibhaibhishe ngondolo nkono nnilo na mmbui kunkono nshinda.<verse eid="MAT 25:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Kungai a Mpalume shibhaalugulilanje bhalinginji kunkono nnilo bhala, “Nnjiyangane mmanganya mpegwilenje mboka na Atati, mposhelanje upalume gummishilwenje tandubhila kupanganywa kwa shilambolyo. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Pabha nashinkukola shibhanga gumbelenje shalya, nashinkukola nnjota gumbelenje mashi, nashinkubha nannjeni gummboshelenje. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Punaliji na uukunu gummbelenje nngubho, punaliji nannwele gunng'ikenje kunnola na ngatabhweje gunng'owelenje.”<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>Penepo, bhandunji bhakwetenje aki bhala shibhaajangulanje bhakulungwa, “Mmakulungwa, shakani putwammweni nni na shibhanga nikumpa shalya, eu nni na nnjota nikumpa mashi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Shakani putwammweni nni mmajeni nikumposhela, eu nni na uukunu nikumpa nngubho nng'wale? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Shakani putwammweni nni mmalwele eu ntabhilwe gutuishe kukunng'owela?” <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>A mpalume shibhaajangulanje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, shindu shoshowe shimuntendelenje jumo jwa ashaapwanga bhanyegalangabha, nshinkundendelanga nne.”<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>Kungai shibhaabhalanjilanje bhalinginji ku nkono nshinda gwabho bhala, “Nnyabhulilanje apano mmaaloshwa! Nnjendangane ku moto gwa pitipiti gwaalashiwe Lishetani na ashimalaika bhakwe. <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Pabha nashinkukola shibhanga mwangambanganga shalya, nashinkukola nnjota mwangambanganga mashi ga ng'wa. <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>Punaliji nannjeni mwangamboshelanga, na punaliji na uukunu mwangambanganga nngubho, punaliji nannwele na punatabhilwe mwangang'owelanga.”<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>Penepo na bhalabhonji shibhaajangulanje, “Mmakulungwa shakani putwammweni nni na shibhanga eu nnjota, nni mmajeni eu nni na uukunu, eu mmalwele eu ntabhilwe twangannjangutila?” <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Na bhalabho shibhaajangulanje, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, kila punkanilenje kwaatendelanga ashaapwanga bhanyegalangabha, nshinkukananga kundendela nne.” <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Bhai, bhanganyabho shibhajendangane ku mboteko ya pitipiti, ikabhe bhakwetenje aki bhala, shibhajendangane ku gumi gwa pitipiti.<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Mpango gwa Kwaabhulaga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maliko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yowana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>A Yeshu bhakamaliyeje bheleketa gowego, gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Mmumanyinji gapitaga mobha gabhili shipinga pagwa shikukuu sha Pashaka na Mwana juka Mundu apinga tendebhukwa shaakomelwe munshalabha.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Gene mobhago bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhanangulungwa bha bhandunji gubhaimenenje pamo nnyumba ja a Kayapa, bhaaliji Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Gubhabheleketenje shibhatendanje bhuli, nkupinga bhaakamulanje a Yeshu kwa unami bhaabhulaganje. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Ikabheje gubhashitenje lyenelyo linatendeshe mobha ga shikukuu, jinakoposhela nnjasha ku bhandu.<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanapakaywa Mauta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maliko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yowana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>A Yeshu pubhaliji ku Bhetania kunngwabho a Shimoni bhaakwete mangundula bhukala, <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>bhakongwe bhamo bhaakwete shupa sha alabhashita sha mauta ga nunjila ga mmbiya yaigwinji, gubhaaishile pubhaalyaga shalya pala, gubhaajitile mauta gala muntwe. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhakabhonanjeje genego guyaashimilenje, gubhashitenje, “Kwa nndi jonanganya nnei? <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>Pabha aga mautaga gakaushiwe kwa mmbiya yaigwinji na elayo nipegwa bhalaganga.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>A Yeshu gubhaimanyi ng'aniyo yabhonji, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Pakuti nnakwaabhuyanga bhakongwebha? Pabha bhenebha bhashindendela shindu sha mmbone. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Bhalaganga nni nabhonji mobha gowe, ikabheje nne ngabha na mmanganya mobha gowe. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Abha bhakongwebha bhashinyitila mauta nkupinga mika tayali kwa mashiko gangu. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, kila pushijilunguywe Ngani ja Mboneji pa shilambolyo, shene shibhatendile bhakongweshi, shipinga lunguywa nkwaakumbushila.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yuda Bhanaakunda Kwaatendebhuka a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maliko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Kungai, a Yuda Ishikaliote, jumo munkumbi gwa likumi limo na bhabhili bhala, gubhaajendelenje bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila, <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>gubhashite, “Shimmbanganje nndi ninkamuyangaga a Yeshu?” Gubhaabhalanganishiyenje mmbiya makumi gatatu. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Tandubhila penepo a Yuda bhatendaga loleya shanabhuli shibhaatendebhushe a Yeshu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukolokoya Shikukuu sha Pashaka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maliko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yowana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Lyubha lya tandubha shikukuu sha mikate jangatagwa ngedule, bhaajiganywa bhabho gubhaajendelenje a Yeshu nikwaabhuya, “Kwei kunkupinga tukakolokoye shalya sha Pashaka?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>A Yeshu gubhaajangwilenje, “Nnjendangane kunjini kuka mundu jumo, nkammalanjilanje, Bhaajiganya bhashite, ‘Malanga gangu gubhang'agulile a Nnungu gabhandishile. Kunngwenu mbinga lila Pashaka na bhaajiganywa bhangu.’ ” <verse eid="MAT 26:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Bhaajiganywa gubhatendilenje malinga shibhalugulilwenje na a Yeshu, gubhakolokoyenje Pashaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Likaisheje ligulo, a Yeshu gubhatemi nkulya shalya na bhaajiganywa bhabho likumi limo na bhabhili bhala. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Bhalinginji nkulya, a Yeshu gubhashite, “Kweli ngunakummalanjilanga, jumo jwenunji apinga ndendebhuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Bhaajiganywa gubhainjikenje kwa kaje, jumo jumo gubhatandubhenje kwaabhuya, “Mmakulungwa! Bhuli, nne?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>A Yeshu gubhajangwile, “Shapambe pamo na nne mmakuli ni apinga ndendebhuka. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Mwana juka Mundu anakwenda malinga Majandiko shigaataya, ikabheje ole gwakwe apinga kuntendebhuka Mwana juka Mundu! Mbaya jwene mundujo akanabhelekwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>A Yuda bhapinjile kwaatendebhuka, gubhaabhushiye, “Mmajiganya! Bhuli, nne?” A Yeshu gubhaajangwile, “Mmwe mmelekete.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kalamu ja Bhakulungwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maliko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Bhakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Bhalinginji nkulya, a Yeshu gubhatolile nkate, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu, gubhagebhenye, gubhaapelenje bhaajiganywa bhabho bhalinkuti, “Ntolanje nniyanganje, sheshino shiilu shangu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Kungai gubhatolile shikombe, gubhatendile eja kwa a Nnungu, gubhaapelenje bhalinkuti, “Mpapilanje mmowe, <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>pabha jejino minyai jangu jikong'ondela malagano, jijitika kwa ligongo lya bhandu, nkupinga bhaleshelelwanje yambi yabhonji. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Ikabheje ngunakunnugulilanga, ngapapila kabhili divai ja shabhibhu mpaka lyubha pushimbapile divai ja ambi na mmanganya Muupalume gwa Atati.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Bhakajimbanjeje lwimbo, gubhashoshilenje, gubhapitengene ku shitumbi sha Misheituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanalondola ga Kanwa na a Petili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maliko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yowana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Shilo sha lelo, mmowe shinngananje nineka, pabha ishijandikwa kuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">‘Shininkome nkushunga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 26:31">na ngondolo shiipwilingane.’<verse eid="MAT 26:31"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Ikabheje nyukaga shininnongolelanje kwenda ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>A Petili gubhaabhalanjile a Yeshu, “Nkali bhowe bhalekangaga kunkulupalila nikummutuka, nne ngammutuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile a Petili, “Kweli ngunakummalanjila, shilo sha lelo lipongo akanabhe kongobhela shinngane patatu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>A Petili gubhaabhalanjile, “Nkali ipinjikwaga kuwa pamo na mmwe, ngu ngankana.” Bhaajiganywa bhananji bhala gubhabheleketenje nneyo peyo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaajuga a Nnungu ku Bhushitani ja Getishimane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maliko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhapite nabhonji ku bhushitani ja Getishemane, gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Ntamangane apano, nne naegejela mmujo kukwaajuga a Nnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Gubhaatolile a Petili na bhana bhabhili bha a Shebhedayo, gubhatandwibhe kuinjika na tenguka. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Gubhaabhalanjilenje bhaajiganywa bhabho, “Ntima gwangu gushiinjika tome nawa, ntamangane apano, nsheyanje pamo na nne.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Bhai, gubhapite mmujo kashoko, gubhagwile namanguku, gubhajujile, bhalinkuti, “Atati, itendekaga ai mbotekoi inambate, ikabheje nngabha malinga shinguti pinga nne, ikabheje malinga shinkupinga mmwe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Gubhaajendelenje bhaajiganywa bhala, gubhaimenenje bhagonilenje. Gubhaalugulile a Petili, “Pakuti mwangasheyanga na nne kapela shaa jimo? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Nsheyanje nkujuga, nkupinga nnalingwanga. Ntima unapinga, ikabheje shiilu shangali mashili.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Gubhapite gwabhili kukwaajuga a Nnungu bhalinkuti, “Atati, ikatendeshe ai mbotekoi kupita gwangali mmbata, bhai inkupinga itendeshe.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Gubhaajendelenje kabhili bhaajiganywa bhala, gubhaimenenje bhagonilenje, pabha bhashinkutopelwanga na lugono.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Bhai, gubhaaleshilenje, nigubhapite kukwaajuga a Nnungu gwatatu kwa malobhe gala pegala. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Kungai gubhaajendelenje bhaajiganywa bhala, gubhaalugulilenje, “Bhuli nnagonangape na pumulila? Nnolanje! Malanga gaishe, Mwana juka Mundu apinga kamuywa mmakono ga bhakwetenje yambi. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Nnjumukanje tujabhule! Nnolanje, andendebhuka jula abhandishile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakamulwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maliko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yowana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Bhai, a Yeshu pubhaaliji nkubheleketa nabhonji, shangupe gubhaishe a Yuda, bha munkumbi gwa likumi limo na bhabhili bhala. Bhali bhalongene nabhonji likundi likulungwa lya bhandunji, bhali bhajigelenje mapanga na ndonga, bhatumilwenje na bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhanangulungwa bha bhandunji. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Na bhaatendebhwishe a Yeshu bhala bhashinkwaapanganga bhandunji shilangulo bhalinkuti, “Bhene bhushinaajambatebho mwaakamulanje.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Bhai a Yuda gubhaajendele a Yeshu, bhalinkuti, “Ngunakunkomaya, Mmaajiganya!” Gubhaajembete.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Ambwiga ntende shinng'ishile.” Bhandunji bhala gubhaikengene, gubhaakamwilenje a Yeshu nikwaatabha.<verse eid="MAT 26:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Jumo munkumbi gwa bhalinginji na a Yeshu bhala akugoloyaga nkono gwakwe, gwaolomwele upanga gwankomile ntumishi jwa Bhakulungwa Bhaabhishila, gwankatile likutu. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>A Yeshu gubhammalanjile, “Bhika upanga gwako nnigonelo lyakwe, pabha jojowe abhulaga na upanga shabhulagwe na upanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Bhuli, nkakumumanyanga kuti ngakombwele kwaajuga Atati, nabhalabho shangupe bhakambeleshele makundi gamakulu makulu likumi limo na bhabhili ga malaika? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Ikabheje pushigamalile bhuli Majandiko gataya kuti inapinjikwa kubha nneyo?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Gene malangago a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje likundi lya bhandunji lila, “Bhuli, nshikwiya ngamulanga nninginji na mapanga na ndonga mbuti nankupokonyola? Mobha gowe munaliji nniekalu nilijiganya mwangangamulanga. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Ikabheje gowega gashitendeka nkupinga gamalile majandiko ga ashinkulondola bha a Nnungu.” Penepo bhaajiganywa bhowe gubhaaleshilenje, nigubhabhutukenje.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu ku Lukumbi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maliko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yowana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Bhai, bhandunji bhaakamwilenje a Yeshu bhala gubhaapelekenje kumui kwa a Kayapa, Bhakulungwa Bhaabhishila, kubhaimenenje bhaajiganya bha Shalia ja a Musha na bhanangulungwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>A Petili gubhaakagwile nnyuma mpaka kulugwani lwa Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila, gubhajinjile nkati gubhatemi pamo na bhalinda, nkupinga bhalole shipinga koposhela.<verse eid="MAT 26:58"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Bhai, bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhalukumbi bhowe gubhaloleyenje ukong'ondelo gwa unami nkupinga bhaabhulaganje a Yeshu, <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>ikabheje gubhalepelenje, nkali bhapalinji bhaakong'ondela bhabhagwinji bha unami. Kungai gubhaikengene bhakong'ondela bhabhili, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>nigubhashitenje, “Bhenebha bhashinkubheleketa, ‘Ngunakombola kulibhomola Liekalu lya a Nnungu nikulishenga kabhili kwa mobha gatatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Bhakulungwa Bhabhishila gubhajimi gubhaabhalanjile a Yeshu, “Bhuli, nkaajangula? Ibhakunkong'ondelanga nndi bhandunjibha?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu bhangaajangula. Bhakulungwa Bhaabhishila gubhaabhalanjile, “Nnumbile kwa lina lya a Nnungu bhakwete gumi na ntubhalanjile monaga mmwe ni a Kilishitu, Bhanabhabho a Nnungu!” <verse eid="MAT 26:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>A Yeshu gubhaalugulile, “Mmwe ni nkubheleketa! Ikabheje ngunakummalanjilanga, tandubhila nnaino, shimummonanje Mwana juka Mundu atemi nkono nnilo gwa Bhakulungwa Bhakwete Mashili, alikwiya mmaunde ga kunnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Penepo Bhakulungwa Bhaabhishila gubhapapwile nngubho yabho gubhashite, “Bhashikupulu! Tunapinga bhaakong'ondela kabhili? Mpilikenenje shibhashite kupulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Nkubhonanga bhuli mmanganya?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “Inapinjikwa bhabhulagwe!”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Kungai gubhaaunilenje mata kumeyo, gubhaakomilenje ubha na bhana gubhaakomilenje mapapa, <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>bhalinkutinji “Mmwe a Kilishitu, bhai ntulondolele gani ankomile!”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Petili Bhanakwaakana a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maliko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yowana 18:15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>A Petili pubhaliji bhatemi palanga lugwani, bhai, ntumishi jumo jwankongwe jwa Bhakulungwa Bhaabhishila akwaajendelaga, nigwashite, “Mmwe pumwaliji pamo na a Yeshu bha ku Galilaya.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>A Petili gubhakanile pa lugwinjili lwa bhowe gubhashite, “Ngakushimanya nkali shinkubheleketa.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Nabhalabho bhalikopoka pa nnango gwa lugwani, ntumishi juna jwankongwe gwabhabhweni, akwaalugulilangaga bhalinginji pepala bhala alinkuti, “Abha pubhaliji pamo na a Yeshu Bhanashaleti.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71"/><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Ikabheje a Petili gubhakanile kabhili bhalilumbila, “Ngakummanya aju munduju.” <verse eid="MAT 26:72"/><verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Kungai, bhandunji bhalinginji pepala gubhaajendelenje a Petili, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Kweli mmwe nkumbi gumo, nkali kubheleketa kwenu kunakummanyiya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Penepo a Petili gubhatandwibhe kwiilosha na lumbila bhalinkuti, “Ngakummanya aju munduju!” Shangupe lipongo likukongobhelaga. <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>A Petili gubhakumbushile malobhe gubhabhalanjilwe na a Yeshu, “Lipongo akanabhe kongobhela, shinngane patatu.” Bhai, gubhakopweshe palanga, gubhagutile kwa kaje.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanapelekwa kwa a Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maliko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yowana 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Lyambape, bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila bhowe na bhanangulungwa bha bhandunji, gubhatemingenenje shitamo sha pinga kwaabhulaga a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Gubhaatabhilenje mindondolo, gubhapite kwaakamuyanga kwa a Pilato bhaaliji bhakulungwa bha shilambo sha ku Yudea.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwa kwa a Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Itendi 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Kungai a Yuda bhaatendebhwishe a Yeshu bhala, bhakamumanyeje kuti a Yeshu bhashiukumulwa, nigubhaigambile, gubhaabhujishiyenje bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhanangulungwa bha bhandu mmbiya ipande makumi gatatu ila. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Bhalinkuti, “Njilebha kwa kuntendebhuka mundu jwangalebha abhulagwe.” Ikabheje bhanganyabho gubhashitenje, “Uwe nndi? Kwali mmayene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Na bhalabho a Yuda gubhaileshele mmbiya ila nniekalu, gubhakopweshe palanga, nikwenda kwiitabhila. <verse eid="MAT 27:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila gubhaitolilenje mmbiya ila nigubhashitenje, “Nngabha alali kuibhika nshibhiko sha mbepei, pabha mmbiya ya minyai.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Bhai, gubhabheleketenje ashaayenenji, nigubhaumilenje nngunda guka nkugumba lilongo pabhe pa shishila bhajeninji <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Kwa nneyo nngunda gula pubhashemangaga, Nngunda gwa Minyai.<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Gugamalile malobhe ga ankulondola bha a Nnungu a Yelemia ga kuti, “Gubhatolilenje mmbiya ipande makumi gatatu, galama jika jwene jubhampanjilenje bhei bha Ishilaeli jula, <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>gubhaumilenje nngunda guka nkugumba lilongo, malinga shibhamalanjile Bhakulungwa.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Pilato Bhanakwaabhuya a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maliko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yowana 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>A Yeshu gubhajimi mmujo ja bhakulungwa bha shilambo sha ku Yudea, bhai, bhakulungwa bhala gubhaabhushiye bhalinkuti, “Bhuli, mmwe a mpalume bha Bhayaudi?” A Yeshu gubhaabhalanjile, “Mmwe ni nkubheleketa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Ikabheje bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhanangulungwa pubhalinginji nkwaukumula, bhangajangula. <verse eid="MAT 27:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Kwa nneyo a Pilato gubhaabhushiye, “Bhuli, nkapilikana indu yowe ibhakunnugulangai?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Ikabheje a Yeshu bhangaajangula nkali lilobhe limo, bhakulungwa bhala gubhakanganigwe kwa kaje.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanaukumulwa Kuwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maliko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yowana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Bhai, gwashinkupagwa nkubho mobha ga shikukuu sha Bhayaudi shishemwa Pashaka, bhakulungwa bhatenda kwaugulilanga atabhilwe jumo jubhampinjilenje bhandunji. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Gene mobhago ashinkupagwa mundu jumo atabhilwe ashumaga ga ya nyata ntima, lina lyakwe a Bhalabha. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Bhai, bhandunji bhakaimananjeje pamo, a Pilato gubhaabhushiyenje, “Jwei junkupinganga ninng'ugulilanje, a Bhalabha eu a Yeshu bhaashemwa a Kilishitu?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Bhashinkubheleketa nneyo pabha bhashinkumumanya kuti bhashikwaapeleshalanga a Yeshu kwa ligongo lya lupimilo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>A Pilato bhakatameje pa shitengu sha ukumu, akongobhabho gubhaapeleshele ntenga, nikwaabhalanjila, “Nnatende shindu shoshowe kuka jwene mundu jwangalebhajo, pabha shilo njilaga nkwaagamilila bhenebho.” <verse eid="MAT 27:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Ikabheje bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhanangulungwa gubhaakwishiyenje bhandunji bhajuganje bhaugulwe a Bhalabha na a Yeshu bhabhulagwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Bhai, bhakulungwa bhala gubhaajangwilenje, “Nnapinganga ning'ugulilanje jwei munkumbi gwa bhene bhabhilibha?” Gubhaajangwilenje, “A Bhalabha!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>A Pilato gubhaabhushiyenje, “Bhai, naatende nndi a Yeshu bhaashemwa a Kilishitu?” Bhowe gubhashitenje, “Bhakomelwe munshalabha!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>A Pilato gubhaabhushiyenje, “Kwa nndi? Ibhalebhile nndi?” Nabhalabhonji gubhapundilenje jobhela, bhalinkutinji, “Bhakomelwe munshalabha!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Bhai, a Pilato bhakabhoneje kuti bhakaakombolanga kwa shoshowe na nnjasha inatandubha, gubhatolile mashi ninabha makono gabho pa lugwinjili lula bhalinkuti, “Nne nangali sha gambwa kwa bhulagwa kuka jwene munduju, kwali mwaashayene.”<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Bhandunji bhowe gubhajangwilenje, “Shiwo sha bhene bhandubha tugambwe uwe na ashibhana bhetu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Bhai a Pilato gubhaaugulilenje a Bhalabha, na ashimanjola bhakaakomanje ibhoko a Yeshu, gubhaakamwiyenje bhakomelwe munshalabha.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ashimanjola Bhanakwaanyegayanga a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maliko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yowana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Kungai ashimanjola bha bhakulungwa bha Shiloma gubhaajinjiyenje a Yeshu nnugwani lukulungwa lwa nyumba ja bhakulungwa bha Shiloma, gubhaimenenje likundi lyowe nikwaatimbilila a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Gubhaaulilenje nngubho yabho, nikwaawasha lijoo lya nnangali. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Gubhaeleyenje ingwa ja mibha, nikwaawasha muntwe, gubhaapelenje nnai kunkono nnilo gwabho. Gubhaatindibhalilenje nikwaanyegaya bhalinkutinji, “Shalamu a Mpalume bha Bhayaudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Kungai gubhaunilenje mata, gubhatolilenje nnai gula, nikwaakomanga muntwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Bhakaanyegayanjeje, gubhaulilenje lijoo lila, gubhaawashiyenje nngubho yabho, kungai gubhapite kwaakomelanga munshalabha.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakomelwa Munshalabha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maliko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yowana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Bhalinginji nkujabhulangana, gubhaabhweninji bhandu bhamo lina lyabho a Shimoni, bha ku Kilene, gubhaashishilishiyenje bhaujigale nshalabha gwa a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Bhakaikanganeje pashemwaga Goligota, malombolelo gakwe Shibhanga sha Ntwe, <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>gubhaapelenje divai ja anganya na shindu sha shashama. Ikabheje a Yeshu bhakapayeje gubhakanile kupapila.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Bhali bhabhambilwe munshalabha, gubhagabhenenje nngubho yabho kwa shikoma, nkupinga limalile lilobhe libhalugwile ankulondola bha a Nnungu, bhashinkugabhananga nngubho yangu kwa shikoma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Majandiko gana ga bhukala gangali gene malobhega, “Nkupinga limalile lilobhe lya ankulondola bha a Nnungu, bhashinkugabhananga nngubho yangu kwa shikoma.”</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Gubhatemingene pala muulinda. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Gubhakomelenje panani ntwe gwabho, ukumu jabho jijandikwe “BHENEBHA NI A YESHU, A MPALUME BHA BHAYAUDI.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Malanga gogo bhaapokonyola bhabhili bhashinkukomelwanga mmishalabha pamo na a Yeshu, jumo kunkono nnilo gwabho na juna kunkono nshinda.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Na bhandunji bhapitangaga mumpanda gubhaatukenenje, bhalitikinyanga mitwe jabhonji bhalinkutinji, <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>“Mmwe mwabhelenje kuti shinnibhomole liekalu nishenga kwa mobha gatatu, mwitapule mmayene, mmaga Mwana gwabho a Nnungu, nntulushe munshalabha!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Nneyo peyo bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na bhaajiganya bha Shalia, na bhanangulungwa gubhaanyegeyenje a Yeshu bhalinkutinji. <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>“Bhashinkwaatapulanga bhananji ikabheje bhanalepela kwiitapula bhayene! Eti bhenebho a mpalume bha Ishilaeli! Bhai, nnaino bhatulushe munshalabha na uwe shitwaakulupalile. <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Bhanakwaakulupalila a Nnungu na bhashite kuti Bhanabhabho a Nnungu, bhai nnaino, a Nnungu monaga bhaapinga bhaatapule.” <verse eid="MAT 27:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Nneyo peyo nkali bhaapokonyola bhakomelwenje mmishalabha pamo na bhenebho bhala gubhaatukenenje.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanawa Munshalabha</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maliko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yowana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Bhai, tandubhila shaa shita ja mui lwashinkupagwa lubhindu pa shilambolyo mpaka shaa tisha. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Jikaisheje shaa tisha a Yeshu gubhautiye lilobhe bhalinkuti, “Eloi, Eloi lama shabhakitani?” Malombolelo gakwe “A Nnungu bhangu, a Nnungu bhangu, pakuti nshineka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Ikabheje bhananji bhajimingenenje pepala, bhakapilikananjeje nneyo gubhashitenje, “Bhanakwaashema a Eliya.” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Shangupe jumo jwabhonji gwabhutwishe lubhilo, gwatolile shiponji ninyobhya divai ja shashama, gwabhishile munnai, nikwaapa bhapapile.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Bhananji gubhashitenje, “Nneshe tulole monaga a Eliya bhanakwiya kwaatapula.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Bhai, a Yeshu gubhakweshiye lilobhe kabhili, gubhawile.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Penepo lipashiya lyaliji nkati liekalu gulipapwishe ipande ibhili, tandubhila kunani mpaka pai, shilambo gushiungumile na maganga makulu gakukaikaga, <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>makabhuli gakuunukaga na bhandunji bha ukonjelo bhawilenje gubhayushiywenje, <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>na bhalabhonji bhakayukanjeje na a Yeshu bhakayusheje, gubhapitengene ku shilambo sha ukonjelo, yani ku Yelushalemu, gubhaakoposhelenje bhandunji bhabhagwinji.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Bhai, bhakulungwa bha manjola na ashimanjola bhalinginji muulinda gwa a Yeshu, bhakabhonanjeje litaka liliungumila na yowe yakoposhele ila, gubhajogopenje kwa kaje, gubhashitenje, “Kweli aju munduju paaliji Mwana jwa a Nnungu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Bhashinkupagwanga bhanabhakongwe bhabhagwinji pepala bhalolangaga bhali bhajimingenenje kwataliya. Bhanganyabho nibhaakagwilenje a Yeshu kopoka ku Galilaya na kwaatumishila. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Munkumbi gwabhonji bhashinkupagwa a Malia Magidalena na a Malia anyinabhabhonji a Yakobho na a Yoshepu pamo na anyinabhabhonji bhana bha a Shebhedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kushikwa kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maliko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yowana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Ikaishileje ligulo, gubhaishe bhandu bhamo atajili bha shilambo sha ku Alimataya, lina lyabho a Yoshepu. Nabhalabho pubhaaliji bhaajiganywa bha a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Gubhaajendele a Pilato gubhaajujile bhapegwe maiti ga a Yeshu. Bhai, a Pilato gubhaamulishe bhapegwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>A Yoshepu gubhatolile maiti gala, gubhailijile nshanda sha takata, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>gubhabhishile maiti gala nnikabhuli lyabho lya ambi libhabheshiye nniganga likulu. Kungai gubhaingilishiye liganga pa nnango gwa likabhuli, gubhaijabhulile. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>A Malia Magidalena na a Malia bhana bhala, gubhatemingene kuloya ku likabhuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ulinda ku Likabhuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Likapiteje Lyubha lya Kolokoya, bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila na Mapalishayo gubhaajendelenje a Pilato, <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>gubhashitenje, “Mmakulungwa, tushikumbushila nnami jula akanabhewa ashinkubheleketa kuti, ‘Gapitaga mobha gatatu shinyushe.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Kwa nneyo nng'amulishe likabhuli libhe muulinda mpaka lyubha lya tatu, nkupinga bhaajiganywa bhakwe bhananjibhanje na kwaabhalanjilanga bhandunji kuti bhayushile. Na unami gwa kumpelo shuunyate kupunda unami gwa kundandubho gula.” <verse eid="MAT 27:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>A Pilato gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Ayaga, manjola nkwetenje, nnjendangane nkabhikanje ulinda malinga shinkukombolanga.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Bhai, gubhabhishilenje ulinda ku likabhuli, nibhika lulembo panani liganga lya ibhila lila na kunani jakwe, nkupinga mundu ashoyaga imanyishe, nigubhaabhishilenje ashimanjola.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Kuyuka kwa a Yeshu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maliko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yowana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Likapiteje Lyubha lya Pumulila, lyambape lyubha lya tandubha juma, a Malia Magidalena na a Malia bhana bhala, gubhapitengene kulola likabhuli. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Shangupe litaka likuungumilaga, pabha malaika jwa Bhakulungwa ashinkutuluka kopoka kunnungu nikuliingilishiya kunyenje liganga lila, nikulitamila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Kubhonekana kwabho bhashinkung'anyima malinga nnjai, na nngubho yabho yashinkuwejela kwa kaje. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Bhalinda bha likabhuli lilla gubhaungumilenje kwa jogopa, gubhalinginji mbuti bhashiwanganga.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Ikabheje malaika jula akwaabhalanjilangaga bhanabhakongwe bhala, “Nnajogopanje, nimumanyi kuti nnakwaaloleyanga a Yeshu bhakomelwe munshalabha. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Bhakwapi apano, pabha bhayushile malinga shibhashite lugula. Nnjiyangane nnolanje pubhaagonekenje. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Bhai, nnjendangane shangu nkaabhalanjilanje bhaajiganywa bhabho kuti, bhayushile bhakaweje na nnaino bhanakunnongolelanga kwenda ku Galilaya, kweneko shimwaabhonanje. Ayaga, nimmalanjilenje.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Bhanabhakongwe gubhashoshilenje shangu pa likabhuli pala, bhalinginji na lipamba na angalala kwa kaje, gubhabhutukenje lubhilo kukwaalugulilanga bhaajiganywa bhabho.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Shangupe, a Yeshu gubhaimene nabhonji, gubhashite, “Shalamu!” Bhanabhakongwe bhala gubhaajendelenje, gubhaatindibhalilenje nikwaakamula makongono gabho. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Kungai a Yeshu gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Nnajogopanje! Nnjendangane nkaabhalanjilanje ashaapwanga bhajendangane ku Galilaya, kweneko shibhamonanje.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntenga gwa Bhalinda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Bhanabhakongwe bhala bhalijabhulangana, bhalinda bhananji bha likabhuli lila, gubhapitengene kunnjini kuupeleka ntenga ku bhakulungwanji bhaabhishila, ga indu yowe ikoposhele. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Bhai, gubhaimenenje pamo na bhanangulungwa, bhakapatananjeje, bhanangulungwa bhala gubhaapelenje bhalinda bhala mmbiya yaigwinji, <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>bhalinkutinji, “Mmanganya ntayanje kuti, ‘Bhaajiganywa bhabho bhashinkuikangana shilo gubhaajibhilenje uwe tuli tugonile.’ <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Monaga bhakulungwa bhapilikanaga, uwe shitukungulushe nabho na mmanganya nkatendwanga shindu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Bhalinda bhala gubhatolilenje mmbiya ila, gubhatendilenje malinga shibhajigenywenje. Na lyene lilobhe lila gulilonjeye kushuma ku Bhayaudi bhowe, mpaka lelo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">A Yeshu Bhanakwaakoposhelanga Bhaajiganywa Bhabho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Bhaajiganywa likumi limo na jumo bhala, gubhapitengene ku Galilaya ku shitumbi shibhaalajiyenje a Yeshu. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Bhaakabhonanjeje, gubhaatindibhalilenje, ikabheje bhananji bhashinkukolanga lipamba. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>A Yeshu gubhabhandishilenje, gubhaabhalanjilenje, “Njipegwa ukulungwa gowe kunnungu na pa shilambolyo. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Bhai, nnjendangane nkaatendanje bhandunji bha ilambo yowe bhabhe bhaajiganywa bhangu, nnikwabhatishanga kwa lina lya Atati na lika Mwana na Mbumu jwa Ukonjelo, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>na kwaajiganyanga kukamula malajilo gowe guning'amulishenje. Na nne puni pamo na mmanganya mpaka mpelo gwa shilambolyo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
